&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s intraday trading in one line: everything begins and ends within a single day.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s the most exciting, most misunderstood, and most dangerous form of trading. SEBI&#39;s own research shows that &lt;strong&gt;more than 90% of intraday traders lose money&lt;/strong&gt; — yet those who master it do it with precision, discipline, and a system.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In this complete guide, you&#39;ll learn what intraday trading really is, how it works mechanically, the best times to trade, how to select stocks, two practical strategies, the truth about leverage, and the rules that separate the profitable 10% from the losing 90%.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Read this slowly. This is the article that can save your capital.&lt;/p&gt;

