&lt;h2 id=&quot;by-category&quot;&gt;Best App for Your Needs (Category Winners)&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Confused by too many options? Here are the shortcut answers:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;If You Are...&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Go With&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;A complete beginner buying first stocks&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Groww&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;An investor who wants a mature, reliable platform&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zerodha&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;A beginner who plans to become an active trader&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upstox&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
