&lt;p&gt;You are not alone. Millions of people hear about the stock market every single day, yet very few actually understand how it works.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In this article, I will explain the stock market in the simplest way possible — from what a share actually is, to how your buy order reaches the market and gets executed. No complicated jargon. Just plain, clear explanations with real-life examples.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;By the end of this article, the stock market will no longer feel like a mystery to you.&lt;/p&gt;

