lfers battle challenging links conditions throughout the day. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://nypost.com/2026/07/17/sports/british-opens-second-round-had-at-all-to-set-up-thrilling-weekend/?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot; title=&quot;British Open&#39;s second round had at all - from tied records to rules drama - to set up thrilling weekend&quot;&gt;New York Post&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of the biggest talking points of the tournament came after Bryson DeChambeau received a controversial two-stroke penalty following his second round. The decision dropped him further behind the leader, but he remains determined to fight back during the weekend. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.reuters.com/sports/golf/bryson-dechambeau-onto-weekend-after-2-stroke-penal--flm-2026-07-18/?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot; title=&quot;Bryson DeChambeau: &#39;Onto the weekend&#39; after 2-stroke penal&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Weather conditions at Royal Birkdale are expected to continue influencing play. The famous links course rewards patience, accuracy, and smart course management, meaning even the smallest mistakes can prove costly as the championship enters its decisive stages. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.olympics.com/en/news/open-championship-2026-schedule-round-scores-leaderboard-royal-birkdale?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot; title=&quot;The Open Championship 2026: Schedule, round scores and leaderboard from Royal Birkdale&quot;&gt;Olympics&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Golf fans around the world are closely following every shot as Round 3 unfolds. With a crowded leaderboard and several star players in contention, today&#39;s action promises exciting moments that could shape the outcome of The Open Championship 2026 before the final round begins. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://nypost.com/2026/07/17/sports/british-opens-second-round-had-at-all-to-set-up-thrilling-weekend/?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot; title=&quot;British Open&#39;s second round had at all - from tied records to rules drama - to set up thrilling weekend&quot;&gt;New York Post&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2026/07/the-open-championship-2026-round-3-live.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgudBR7y_5gZbzW5i9_tFrhugaOcDN4eT6baBGZlCgE5nD9RDvwvFsotjJ1Wukr9z50IzSiyYFJFW6GEhv1cygV5QLlWqFtNTaUaRGXT6cYJxwvRVYQ3NaC521bP_pk6CWHX2HLkQVuGwLvnurcod6UcI7pHkqCGae5ax2WH0vPihs6pWzC1ovXalqG2EA/s72-c/Screenshot%202026-07-18%20132234.png" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-8498961113479250891</guid><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 07:46:21 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-07-18T13:16:21.068+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">golf</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">sport</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">The Open Championship</category><title>The Open Championship 2026 Live: Round 3 Leaderboard, Scores &amp; Latest Updates</title><description>&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgwcKINJ2gIo-P_nzSS1H3yoWTk2u4dkp2d6h-EHS-Rm7ZWOZPGQo-A7s3yeYSy2TjashGiYUo9YFud5j-bzhd8Iz9v5BdnvcYL9Jdo-a8NcDj9VDI1nio957AkJGFv3ObNQJTunKDozFKSPvI0XcMYs9YNqKSf2hVD5uS9s6bxcHfcLKrZYSiBXlgcM_0/s1161/Screenshot%202026-07-18%20130345.png&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;632&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1161&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgwcKINJ2gIo-P_nzSS1H3yoWTk2u4dkp2d6h-EHS-Rm7ZWOZPGQo-A7s3yeYSy2TjashGiYUo9YFud5j-bzhd8Iz9v5BdnvcYL9Jdo-a8NcDj9VDI1nio957AkJGFv3ObNQJTunKDozFKSPvI0XcMYs9Y