&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pro Tip:&lt;/strong&gt; Download the JioCinema app and keep it updated. If Viacom18 wins the bid, they will likely announce free streaming well before the tournament begins.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;2. What If SonyLIV Gets the Rights? (The Telecom Loophole)&lt;/h2&gt;

