&lt;p&gt;However, you can still watch it without paying extra by using these clever telecom loopholes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jio Prepaid Recharge Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Jio offers bundled SonyLIV subscriptions with specific prepaid plans (usually the Rs. 2999 annual plan or specific cricket/football packs). Recharge with these plans, and you get SonyLIV Premium access for free.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Airtel Thanks Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; Airtel prepaid and broadband users often get free SonyLIV subscriptions through the Airtel Thanks app. Check your app to see if you are eligible.&lt;/li&gt;
