    &lt;p style=&quot;margin: 6px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;JioCinema holds the official IPL broadcasting rights in India and offers free live streaming. This is the safest and best legal way to &lt;strong&gt;watch IPL free online&lt;/strong&gt; without needing a subscription.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;alt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;2. Hotstar / Disney+ Hotstar&lt;/strong&gt;
