  &lt;!--Meta Description--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-meta&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-meta-label&quot;&gt;Meta Description&lt;/span&gt;
    Unlock infinite styles with &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Qwen+AI&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Qwen AI&lt;/a&gt;! Discover 13 ultra-realistic prompts to transform your selfies into stunning &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=K-drama+style&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;K-drama&lt;/a&gt; or high-fashion portraits.
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Main Image--&gt;
  &lt;img alt=&quot;Qwen AI Girl Portraits&quot; class=&quot;qwen-main-img&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDWTOrYYUgDZft7pVltN3aPTOPPuYktC4WWNEC5ZhIvRSiMaoQn9m3HafDR2GBEneYSFBXDDnjp5W1uuBCCTMgaruonxwE4VRcC3uRrbdZwAaozNLDGeTSaxBOvFYN9tJ-ZUMWjnX2sGzLjKe1VBfKEERsC5VK815q8eHhQpkEmXnoQl1MpxPJU2MhX78/s745/Unlock-Infinite-Styles_-13-Qwen-AI-Prompts-for-Ultra-Realistic-Girl-Portraits.jpeg&quot; /&gt;

  &lt;!--Intro--&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Imagine stepping into a parallel universe where you are a soft K-drama heroine in one moment and a high-fashion &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Vogue+magazine&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vogue&lt;/a&gt; cover star the next. With &lt;strong&gt;Qwen AI&lt;/strong&gt;, you don’t need a wardrobe change or a professional photographer—you just need the right words.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Qwen’s advanced image editing engine preserves your exact facial features while transforming your outfit, lighting, and background into stunning, 8K-ready art. Whether you want a cozy indoor vibe or a bold editorial look, these 13 prompts will turn a simple selfie into a cinematic masterpiece.&lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;!--How To Section--&gt;
  &lt;h2&gt;How to Create Your Portrait&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Follow these steps to ensure your face stays realistic while the style transforms:&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;ol&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open the Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Launch &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Qwen+Chat&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Qwen Chat&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; or any app that supports Qwen-Image or &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Qwen-Image-Edit&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Qwen-Image-Edit&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upload Photo:&lt;/strong&gt; Select &lt;strong&gt;Image Editing&lt;/strong&gt; and upload a clear, well-lit selfie.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paste Prompt:&lt;/strong&gt; Copy one of the prompts below.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;background: rgb(38, 50, 56); border-left: 3px solid rgb(255, 213, 79); margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Crucial Step:&lt;/em&gt; Add this line to the end of every prompt to protect your identity: &lt;br /&gt;“keep same face and identity, &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=photorealistic+skin+AI+examples&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;photorealistic skin&lt;/a&gt;, no cartoon look”&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Settings:&lt;/strong&gt; Choose &lt;strong&gt;Portrait Orientation&lt;/strong&gt; and select the highest quality (HD or 8K).&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate:&lt;/strong&gt; Click Edit. If the style isn&#39;t perfect, tweak specific details (like &quot;red top&quot; to &quot;blue top&quot;) and regenerate.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ol&gt;

  &lt;h2&gt;13 Qwen AI Prompts for Every Aesthetic&lt;/h2&gt;

  &lt;!--Category 1--&gt;
  &lt;h3&gt;🌿 Outdoor &amp;amp; Nature Aesthetics&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;1. Soft Sky Aesthetic Portrait&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Lifestyle portraits and Instagram lookbooks.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a highly realistic outdoor portrait of a young woman with the exact same facial features as the reference. She is wearing an oversized vintage-style shirt with balloon sleeves paired with a wide denim skirt. On her wrist, she wears an Apple smartwatch. The scene is set outdoors under a bright blue sky with thin, scattered white clouds. She is standing with her back facing the camera, head slightly tilted downward. One hand is placed behind her back, holding five bright yellow sunflowers. Makeup is &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Korean-inspired+makeup+fashion&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Korean-inspired&lt;/a&gt;: smooth matte base, fresh pink blush, and natural pink lips. Use a &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=DSLR+portrait+style&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;DSLR-style portrait look&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=define+shallow+depth+of+field&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;shallow depth of field&lt;/a&gt;, and soft background separation. Keep everything natural and authentic.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;2. Tropical Vintage Dress Portrait&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Vintage digicam-style posts and café aesthetics.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a highly realistic outdoor portrait of a young woman with the same facial features as the reference. She is wearing a muted olive green/dark sage green dress made from textured denim-like fabric with distinctive white contrast stitching. Her hair is long, dark brown, styled in loose natural waves with curtain bangs. The setting is a lush tropical environment with large dark green leaves. Behind her is a rustic café exterior made of dark, weathered wooden slats, with a partial sign showing teal letters &#39;AM&#39;. Use soft natural daylight combined with a strong direct camera flash for a retro early-2000s digicam aesthetic. Use a 50mm prime lens, f/1.8, shallow depth of field.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;7. Golden Hour Outdoor Glow&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Radiant lifestyle visuals.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic outdoor portrait of a young woman standing in an open field during &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=golden+hour+photography&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;golden hour&lt;/a&gt;. Warm sunlight falls diagonally across her face, creating soft highlights and gentle shadows. She wears a flowy pastel dress, hair moving naturally in the breeze. The background shows softly blurred greenery and warm sky tones. Use cinematic lighting, natural skin tones, shallow depth of field, and realistic color balance.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;12. Nature-Inspired Serenity&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Serene garden content.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic portrait of a young woman surrounded by greenery in a quiet garden or park. She wears a light floral dress, minimal makeup, and natural hair styling. Sunlight filters through leaves, creating soft patterns of light and shadow on her face. Use natural color tones, realistic textures, and gentle background blur.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Category 2--&gt;
  &lt;h3&gt;✨ Indoor &amp;amp; Cozy Vibes&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;3. Soft Dewy Indoor Portrait&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Beauty portraits and close-ups.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a hyper-realistic close-up indoor portrait of a young woman using the exact same face from the reference. She is wearing a cute sleeveless red top. Her skin has a natural dewy glow with visible freckles across the cheeks and nose, enhanced by a soft peachy blush. Makeup is minimal: light foundation, defined thick brows, and glossy red lips. Her dark brown straight hair falls loosely over her shoulders in a butterfly cut. The background is slightly blurred, showing a cozy modern room with neutral tones. Capture in cinematic 8K DSLR quality, realistic skin texture, and warm color tones.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;9. Cozy Indoor Window Portrait&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Calm aesthetic posts and reels.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic indoor portrait of a young woman sitting beside a window during soft morning light. She wears a cozy neutral sweater, hair loosely tied, with a calm, thoughtful expression. Natural light reflects softly on her skin, while the background fades into a gentle blur. Use shallow depth of field, realistic shadows, warm color tones, and high-resolution detail. Avoid artificial glow.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Category 3--&gt;
  &lt;h3&gt;💄 High-Fashion &amp;amp; Editorial&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;4. Vogue Minimal Editorial Portrait&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Magazine covers and luxury portfolios.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a hyper-realistic &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Vogue-style+fashion+editorial+portrait&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=7982833113933157926&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vogue-style fashion editorial portrait&lt;/a&gt; using the exact same face from the reference. Do not change facial features. The composition features a clean white background. The young woman is wearing a white feminine blouse with buttons. She poses in a refined editorial stance, with one arm partially covering her face. A metallic feminine wristwatch is clearly visible on her wrist. Lighting is soft, studio-grade fashion lighting—evenly diffused and clean. Capture in Vogue editorial style, HD/magazine-ready finish, no filters.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;5. Haute Couture Power Editorial&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: High-fashion branding and power visuals.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a hyper-realistic cinematic editorial fashion portrait using the exact same face from the reference. The scene shows an elegant woman sitting confidently in a modern white leather armchair. She is wearing a sleek, tailored white suit paired with a plain white shirt. The background features a warm reddish-orange gradient with a soft atmospheric haze. Lighting is soft yet directional, sculpting her facial features and jawline. Use luxury editorial lighting, controlled shadows, and elegant color grading. Maintain a refined, premium magazine aesthetic.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;8. Minimal Studio Elegance&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Professional profile photos.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a clean, ultra-realistic studio portrait of a young woman against a soft beige or grey background. She wears a simple white or pastel outfit with minimal makeup and neatly styled hair. Lighting is soft and evenly diffused, enhancing facial contours without harsh shadows. Use high-definition clarity, realistic skin texture, subtle shadows, and natural contrast.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;13. Artistic Side-Profile Portrait&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Creative profile images.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic side-profile portrait of a young woman against a softly textured background. Soft directional lighting highlights facial contours, jawline, and hair texture. She wears a simple outfit with minimal jewelry. Use shallow depth of field, clean composition, and natural color grading for an artistic yet realistic look.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Category 4--&gt;
  &lt;h3&gt;🌃 Modern &amp;amp; Glamour&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;6. Soft Editorial Natural Light&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Premium minimalist portraits.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic editorial-style portrait of a young woman standing near a tall window with sheer curtains. Soft natural daylight gently illuminates her face, highlighting real skin texture, subtle freckles, and natural makeup. She wears a neutral-toned blouse with minimal jewelry, hair styled loosely with soft waves. The background is clean and softly blurred. Use shallow depth of field, balanced exposure, and true-to-life color grading.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;10. Confident Urban Look&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Street-style and personal branding.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic urban portrait of a young woman standing confidently on a city street. She wears a modern outfit—a structured jacket, a casual top, and minimal accessories. Natural daylight highlights her facial features, while buildings and street elements blur softly in the background. Use cinematic contrast, sharp focus on the subject, and realistic color grading.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;11. Soft Glam Evening Portrait&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;qwen-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Elegant evening aesthetics.&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;qwen-prompt-box&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic evening portrait of a young woman under soft ambient lighting. She wears a stylish dark outfit with subtle makeup—defined eyes, natural lips, and glowing skin. Warm light creates gentle highlights and soft bokeh in the background. Use shallow depth of field, realistic skin tones, and cinematic lighting without exaggeration.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

