&lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-dark-container&quot;&gt;

  &lt;!--Meta Description--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-meta-box&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;hunyuan-meta-label&quot;&gt;Meta Description&lt;/span&gt;
    Turn ordinary selfies into magical &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=K-drama+aesthetic&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;K-drama&lt;/a&gt; scenes with &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Hunyuan+3.0&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Hunyuan 3.0&lt;/a&gt;! Discover 12 &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=romantic+fairy+light+prompts+AI&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;romantic fairy-light prompts&lt;/a&gt; to create stunning 4K couple portraits.
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Main Image--&gt;
  &lt;img alt=&quot;Hunyuan 3.0 Romantic Fairy Light Portraits&quot; class=&quot;hunyuan-main-img&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPkvL1YCcXWJxclTJzMGmf5QaWNPTiTGdpYwo3EtDbRkDcns5XCJgkD-IboxAbwIsyNWiiNO1XT8MOUQHpHnWwwMrMTGf0-ngTgbKFOZy3xAk3yoPpkEkSd6XQbIGJeWyRA3hjyy8MGfMXyM8T663y3s2-gRjni2xm3KOTOSLc5A0ptlR4DW4T1AsyCpg/s1376/Turn-Selfies-into-Magic_-12-Hunyuan-3.0-Prompts-for-Romantic-Fairy-Light-Portraits.jpeg&quot; /&gt;

  &lt;!--Intro--&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Transform an ordinary couple selfie into a scene straight out of a K-drama or a romantic movie poster. With &lt;strong&gt;Hunyuan Image 3.0&lt;/strong&gt;, you can wrap your photos in warm &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=define+bokeh+photography&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;bokeh&lt;/a&gt;, glowing fairy lights, and cinematic intimacy while keeping your faces perfectly realistic.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Whether you want a cozy indoor vibe or a dreamy outdoor setting, these 12 prompts will help you create ultra-realistic 4K–8K couple portraits that are perfect for anniversaries, Instagram feeds, or printed keepsakes.&lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;!--How To Section--&gt;
  &lt;h2&gt;How to Use These Prompts&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-steps&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Follow these simple steps to get the best romantic results:&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;ol&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open the Tool:&lt;/strong&gt; Access a platform supporting &lt;strong&gt;Hunyuan Image 3.0&lt;/strong&gt; (such as hunyuan-image.com, Dzine, or similar AI editors).&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upload:&lt;/strong&gt; Select &lt;strong&gt;Image-to-Image&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Photo Editing&lt;/strong&gt; and upload a clear couple photo where faces are visible.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paste Prompt:&lt;/strong&gt; Copy one of the prompts below.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-pro-tip&quot;&gt;
        &lt;em&gt;Pro Tip:&lt;/em&gt; Always add this line at the end of every prompt to ensure accuracy:&lt;br /&gt;
        &quot;keep both faces exactly the same, ultra-realistic skin, no cartoon look&quot;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Settings:&lt;/strong&gt; Set the aspect ratio to portrait (3:4 or 9:16) and resolution to high (4K or 8K).&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate:&lt;/strong&gt; Create your image. If the lighting isn&#39;t quite right, simply tweak words like &quot;warm&quot; to &quot;golden&quot; or &quot;soft&quot; to &quot;dim&quot; and regenerate.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ol&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;h2&gt;12 Romantic Fairy-Light Prompts&lt;/h2&gt;

  &lt;!--Category 1--&gt;
  &lt;h3&gt;🏙️ Urban &amp;amp; Date Night Vibes&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 1--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;1. Balcony Whisper Lights&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Romantic city posts.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic romantic couple portrait set on a private apartment balcony at night, illuminated by &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=warm+fairy+lights+decoration+images&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;warm fairy lights&lt;/a&gt; wrapped along the railing. The couple stands close together, facing each other, &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=foreheads+gently+touching+romantic+pose+images&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;foreheads gently touching&lt;/a&gt;, eyes closed in a quiet moment. He wears a crisp white shirt with rolled sleeves; she wears a soft pastel dress flowing lightly in the breeze. City lights blur in the background, creating &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=dreamy+bokeh+photography+examples&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;dreamy bokeh&lt;/a&gt;. Use soft warm lighting, &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=shallow+depth+of+field+examples&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;shallow depth of field&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=natural+skin+texture+AI+art&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;natural skin texture&lt;/a&gt;, and gentle cinematic color grading for an &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=intimate+cozy+atmosphere+images&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;intimate, cozy atmosphere&lt;/a&gt;.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 2--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;2. Rooftop Night Romance&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Stylish, modern couple visuals.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a romantic couple portrait on a rooftop terrace at night, surrounded by fairy lights and lanterns. The couple stands close, one arm around the waist, the other gently touching the partner’s face. City skyline lights shimmer in the distance. Use warm highlights, soft shadows, cinematic depth, and realistic expressions for a modern romantic vibe.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 3--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;3. Café Window Fairy-Light Moment&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Aesthetic date night content.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic romantic portrait of a couple sitting inside a cozy café near a window decorated with fairy lights. They sit across from each other, leaning forward, smiling softly, hands almost touching on the table. Warm indoor lighting reflects off glass surfaces, creating a dreamy glow. Keep tones warm and natural.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 4--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;4. Staircase Glow Romance&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Elegant, playful couple edits.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a cinematic couple portrait on a staircase decorated with fairy lights along the railing. The couple stands on different steps, leaning toward each other, sharing a playful smile. Use warm light gradients, shallow depth of field, and clean composition for an elegant romantic feel.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Category 2--&gt;
  &lt;h3&gt;🏡 Cozy &amp;amp; Intimate Indoors&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 5--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;5. Bedside Glow Intimacy&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Private, cozy moments.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic intimate couple portrait inside a softly lit bedroom decorated with warm fairy lights on the wall behind them. The couple sits close on the bed, leaning into each other, sharing a quiet smile. She wears a cozy neutral sweater; he wears a casual t-shirt. Lighting is low, warm, and diffused, emphasizing closeness and comfort. Background is softly blurred for depth.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 6--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;6. Living-Room Fairy-Light Hug&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Authentic lifestyle portraits.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic romantic couple portrait inside a warmly decorated living room filled with fairy lights. The couple embraces gently near a sofa, smiling naturally. Lighting is soft and warm, background blurred with glowing bokeh. Keep the atmosphere intimate, relaxed, and authentic.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 7--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;7. Window-Sill Fairy Light Embrace&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Emotional storytelling.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic romantic couple portrait set near a large window sill at night, softly decorated with warm fairy lights draped around the frame. The couple sits closely on the window ledge, shoulders touching. One partner gently rests their head on the other’s shoulder while holding hands loosely. Both wear cozy, neutral-tone outfits. Outside the window, faint city lights and night sky appear softly blurred. Use warm indoor lighting combined with subtle cool tones from outside, shallow depth of field, natural skin texture, and gentle bokeh.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Category 3--&gt;
  &lt;h3&gt;🌲 Nature &amp;amp; Adventure&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 8--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;8. Garden Path Fairy-Light Stroll&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Dreamy outdoor portraits.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a cinematic romantic couple portrait set on a garden pathway lined with fairy lights hanging from trees. The couple walks slowly hand-in-hand, smiling and looking at each other, captured mid-step. She wears a light floral dress; he wears casual linen attire. Soft greenery and glowing lights blur behind them. Use warm ambient lighting, realistic fabric movement, shallow depth of field, and a soft romantic haze.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 9--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;9. Tent-Light Adventure Romance&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Camping and travel couples.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a romantic couple portrait inside a &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=small+camping+tent+romantic+setting+images&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;small camping tent&lt;/a&gt; decorated with fairy lights. The couple sits close, wrapped in a shared blanket, laughing quietly. Warm fairy lights illuminate their faces against a dark outdoor background. Clothing is casual and cozy. Use soft lighting, shallow depth of field, and a warm color palette.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 10--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;10. Beachside Evening Glow&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Ocean and sunset lovers.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an intimate romantic couple portrait on a quiet beach during evening twilight. Fairy lights are strung between wooden poles, softly illuminating the couple. They stand close, holding hands, gazing at the ocean. She wears a flowing dress; he wears relaxed beachwear. Use soft blue-gold tones, gentle wind movement, and &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=cinematic+lighting+photography+examples&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4851327069710802976&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;cinematic lighting&lt;/a&gt;.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Category 4--&gt;
  &lt;h3&gt;🌧️ Moody &amp;amp; Artistic&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 11--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;11. Rainy Window Fairy-Light Mood&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Moody, emotional portraits.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create an ultra-realistic romantic couple portrait near a window with raindrops visible outside. Fairy lights hang softly in the background. The couple stands close, wrapped in a light embrace, gazing outward together. Use cool rain tones mixed with warm fairy-light glow for emotional contrast.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 12--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h4 class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-title&quot;&gt;12. Backyard Fairy-Light Dance Moment&lt;/h4&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Joyful celebration edits.&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;hunyuan-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a cinematic romantic couple portrait set in a private backyard or open terrace at night, decorated with hanging fairy lights overhead. The couple shares a slow, playful dance—one partner gently spinning the other, both smiling mid-movement naturally. She wears a soft flowing dress; he wears a relaxed outfit with rolled sleeves. The fairy lights create glowing orbs of bokeh around them. Use warm golden lighting, motion-friendly composition, realistic fabric movement, and natural expressions.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

