&lt;div class=&quot;seedream-container&quot;&gt;

  &lt;!--Meta Description--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;seedream-meta-box&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;seedream-meta-label&quot;&gt;Meta Description&lt;/span&gt;
    Transform your selfies into art with &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Seedream+4.0&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Seedream 4.0&lt;/a&gt;! Discover &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=dreamy+prompts+AI+art&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;10 dreamy prompts&lt;/a&gt; to create &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=aesthetic+collage+portraits+examples&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;aesthetic collage portraits&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=floating+florals+portrait+images&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;floating florals&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=film+grain+effect&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;film grain&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=vintage+vibes+aesthetic&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;vintage vibes&lt;/a&gt;.
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Main Image--&gt;
  &lt;img alt=&quot;Transform Your Selfies into Art with Seedream 4.0&quot; class=&quot;seedream-main-img&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjNQifEuRlEA6BA_Fw8bhEnoyTfHU7ss8OeXUge_GbdOryffTULiCOWO71A9H6HM4SDmEYUo-2508GFvUYrYvBBiWSZbuh5fJxNW1bIbOarPIvsqAqOAMnsPt0BBm0s-RCgwfG5GwnUB9l8nHKXXWaiRfpXqZsLI7jM7NGChMQZrFbmiClgi8mfUpFoVdI/s1376/Transform-Your-Selfies-into-Art_-10-Seedream-4.0-Prompts-for-Dreamy-Collage-Portraits.jpeg&quot; /&gt;

  &lt;!--Intro--&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Pinterest+vision+boards&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pinterest vision boards&lt;/a&gt; and aesthetic magazine spreads are no longer just for inspiration—they can now feature &lt;em&gt;you&lt;/em&gt;. With Seedream 4.0, you can turn a single selfie into an &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=ultra-realistic+moodboard+style+AI+art&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ultra-realistic, moodboard-style masterpiece&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;This AI model excels at layering textures, floating florals, film grain, and vintage frames while keeping your facial features and skin tone perfectly intact. Whether you want a &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=golden-hour+vibe+photography&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;golden-hour vibe&lt;/a&gt; or a soft, vintage look, these prompts will help you generate custom HD collage portraits that look professionally art-directed.&lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;!--How To Section--&gt;
  &lt;h2&gt;How to Create Your Image&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;seedream-steps&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Follow these simple steps to get the best results on Seedream 4.0 (or platforms like &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Freepik+AI&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Freepik AI&lt;/a&gt;):&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;ol&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Select Your Tool:&lt;/strong&gt; Open Seedream 4.0 or a compatible AI image generator.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upload Photo:&lt;/strong&gt; Choose &lt;strong&gt;Image Editing&lt;/strong&gt; and upload a clear, front-facing selfie with good lighting.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paste Prompt:&lt;/strong&gt; Copy one of the prompts below.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;div class=&quot;seedream-pro-tip&quot;&gt;
        &lt;em&gt;Pro Tip:&lt;/em&gt; Add this line to the end of every prompt for consistency:&lt;br /&gt;
        &quot;keep same face, natural skin, dreamy collage layout, no cartoon look, 4K resolution.&quot;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Settings:&lt;/strong&gt; Choose a &lt;strong&gt;Portrait aspect ratio&lt;/strong&gt; and select &lt;strong&gt;High Resolution (2K/4K)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate:&lt;/strong&gt; Click generate. If the result isn&#39;t perfect, tweak specific colors or background elements and try again.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ol&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;h2&gt;10 Seedream 4.0 Dreamy Collage Prompts&lt;/h2&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 1--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;seedream-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h3 class=&quot;seedream-prompt-title&quot;&gt;1. The Romantic Floral Bloom&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;seedream-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Instagram aesthetics, lifestyle collages, and romantic storytelling.&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;div class=&quot;seedream-prompt-text&quot;&gt;&quot;Create a beautiful, soft-focus collage portrait of a young woman using the exact face from the uploaded reference image. The composition should blend three harmonious poses into a single dreamy frame with smooth transitions.

*   &lt;strong&gt;Pose 1 (Close-up):&lt;/strong&gt; A bright, playful close-up where she is smiling warmly, holding a small yellow flower near her nose.
*   &lt;strong&gt;Pose 2 (Mid-shot):&lt;/strong&gt; She is smiling gently while adjusting a yellow flower in her hair, captured at eye level.
*   &lt;strong&gt;Pose 3 (Full-body):&lt;/strong&gt; A graceful full-body shot of her smiling downward, calm and serene, with a yellow flower tucked into her hair.

She is wearing a light pink dress. The background is dreamy with &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=pastel+tones+color+palette&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;pastel tones&lt;/a&gt;, soft light leaks, subtle bokeh, and a gentle haze. Use shallow depth of field and &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=define+cinematic+color+grading&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4351808859119188802&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;cinematic color grading&lt;/a&gt; for a poetic, warm atmosphere.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!--Prompt 2--&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;seedream-prompt-card&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h3 class=&quot;seedream-prompt-title&quot;&gt;2. Golden Hour Memory&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;seedream-best-for&quot;&gt;Best for: Romantic lifestyle branding and warm-toned feeds.&lt;/div&gt;
    
