&lt;p data-end=&quot;862&quot; data-start=&quot;670&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;699&quot; data-start=&quot;670&quot;&gt;Why visit Ooty in summer?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-end=&quot;702&quot; data-start=&quot;699&quot; /&gt;
Ooty in summer offers cool weather, green surroundings, and a peaceful environment, making it one of the best hill stations in South India for summer vacations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-end=&quot;901&quot; data-start=&quot;864&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;887&quot; data-start=&quot;864&quot;&gt;Best time to visit:&lt;/strong&gt; March to June&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Travel Tips for Summer Vacations&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Book flights and hotels early (summer is peak season).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Choose destinations with mild or cool weather.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Carry sunscreen, hats, and hydration essentials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prefer early morning sightseeing to avoid crowds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Conclusion&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the romantic streets of Paris to the cool mountains of Manali and Leh, these &lt;strong&gt;top 10 best cities to visit in summer&lt;/strong&gt; offer something for every traveler. Whether you want beaches, adventure, culture, or relaxation, these destinations guarantee unforgettable summer memories.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you are planning your next vacation, choose one of these cities and make the most of your summer travel season.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Tags / Keywords (for Blogger &amp;amp; SEO)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;best cities to visit in summer, summer travel destinations, best summer vacation cities, Paris summer travel, Reykjavik summer, &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Leh+Ladakh+summer+trip&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=4994297753870586848&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Leh Ladakh&lt;/a&gt; summer trip, Manali summer vacation, Barcelona beach summer, Ooty hill station, Darjeeling summer travel&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/top-10-best-cities-to-visit-in-summer.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg58OwB_J6CtbpPqrWdGaYYONdtSd3mi8f38GNKPP_xN6j9DgN8cGja4RJuVrr08hwaZRqgYci30IDzyMJaSlsunyL8I3fKFBKLHFLatGoQoiSxd65ZX8MeQGJIdsj5XXu-ZZIeB8dUisVQqWUZ3QkqapdZGsOPri9Ym2GjR5LFp1Ds4adEbBRSGKe6XhE/s72-c/Untitleddesign31.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-1319526399122056016</guid><pubDate>Mon, 22 Dec 2025 16:06:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-03-12T02:23:21.223+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">blog</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">mix</category><title>Hollywood Se Bollywood Tak: Space Movie Shock, Street Fighter Casting, Pathan 2 &amp; Toxic — All Major News</title><description>&lt;p&gt;Hello guys — welcome back to your favourite spot for pop-culture news. Aaj ek detailed roundup leke aaye hain jisme Hollywood se Bollywood tak ki badi khabrein hain. Toh bina deri ke shuru karte hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Tom+Cruise&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tom Cruise&lt;/a&gt; ki SpaceX + NASA wali movie abhi shelved ho chuki hai. Reports ke mutabik federal approval ki zaroorat thi, aur Tom Cruise ne Donald Trump se personal favour maangne se mana kar diya — isi wajah se project aage nahi badha. Future me political changes se revival ho sakta hai, par abhi kuch confirm nahi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Street+Fighter+live-action+cast&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Street Fighter&lt;/a&gt; live-action ka full cast look release ho gaya hai. Sabki nazar &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Vidyut+Jammwal&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vidyut Jammwal&lt;/a&gt; ke pehle look par hai — transformation itna heavy hai ki pehchanna mushkil ho raha hai. Cast me Jason Momoa as Blanka, 50 Cent as Balrog, Cody Rhodes as Guile aur Roman Reigns jaise names bhi include hain. Film worldwide theatres me 16 October 2026 ko release hogi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Peaky+Blinders+movie+details&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Peaky Blinders movie&lt;/a&gt; se Cillian Murphy ka naya Thomas Shelby look reveal hua — darker aur zyada intense. Ye signal deta hai ki film ek cinematic continuation hogi, na ki sirf extended episode.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Timothée Chalamet ne bataya hai ki &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Dune+Part+3+time+jump&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dune Part 3&lt;/a&gt; me story me 15–20 saal ka time jump hoga. Iska matlab characters ki growth aur kuch major shifts honge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Netflix ka &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Extraction+universe&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Extraction universe&lt;/a&gt; expand ho raha hai — spin-off series “Mercy” filming me hai, aur Anthony-Joe Russo is project ke executive producers hain. Expect karein heavy action aur extended worldbuilding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://img.youtube.com/vi/i-Rckle1SUg/maxresdefault.jpg&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;image credit - youtube&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;720&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1280&quot; src=&quot;https://img.youtube.com/vi/i-Rckle1SUg/maxresdefault.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;image credit - youtube /&amp;nbsp;@ReporterRoommate&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;yt-content-metadata-view-model__delimiter yt-content-metadata-view-model__delimiter--standalone&quot; face=&quot;Roboto, Arial, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; color: #606060; display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; margin: 2px 4px 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;Roboto, Arial, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: #0f0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;IMAX ne “&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=IMAX+Canley+Camera+details&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IMAX Canley Camera&lt;/a&gt;” launch kiya — David aur Patricia Canley ko honour karte hue. Ye camera &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Christopher+Nolan&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Christopher Nolan&lt;/a&gt; ki &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=The+Odyssey+Christopher+Nolan&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;The Odyssey&lt;/a&gt; ke liye pehli baar use hua. Nolan fans 4K/IMAX experience ke liye excited hain; film ka release 17 July 2026 set hai.&lt;p&gt;Teaser alert: &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Alejandro+G.+Inerra+Digger+movie&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Alejandro G. Inerra&lt;/a&gt; (ya similar naam) ki film Digger me reportedly Tom Cruise lead role me hain. Ye ek comedy lagti hai jisme ek powerful aadmi khud ko humanity ka saviour prove karna chahta hai, jabki uski duniya hi disastrous ho rahi hoti hai — concept ironic aur interesting hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Christopher Nolan ki The Odyssey ka naya poster out ho chuka hai aur anticipation high hai. Nolan ke scale aur visual ambitions ki wajah se log 4K experience ke liye wait kar rahe hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kuch reports suggest karti hain ki Oscars 2029 YouTube par stream ho sakte hain — traditional TV ke bajaye global digital rights pe focus. Agar sach hua to Oscars ka reach aur format dono badal sakte hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Marvel leaks ne internet par hungama macha diya — &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Avengers:+Dooms+Day+leaks&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Avengers: Dooms Day&lt;/a&gt; se related kuch moments leak hue hain, jisme Steve Rogers family angle me dikhte hain aur Peter Parker struggle me nazar aata hai. Aise leaks fans me mixed reactions laate hain — excitement aur concerns dono.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bollywood highlights: &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Yash+Toxic+movie&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Yash&lt;/a&gt; ki pan-India entertainer &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Toxic+Yash+film&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Toxic&lt;/a&gt; ka countdown chal raha hai — release 19 March 2026 (Eid weekend). Isi din Ranveer Singh ki &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Dhurandhar+2+release+date&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dhurandhar 2&lt;/a&gt; bhi release ho rahi hai, isliye bada box-office clash expect kiya ja raha hai. Shah Rukh Khan ne &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Pathan+2&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1319526399122056016&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pathan 2&lt;/a&gt; confirm kar diya hai. Salman Khan ka Kick 2 reveal 27 December (reportedly) plan hai; rumours me Kriti Sanon opposite ho sakti hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dhurandhar ne Pakistan me 2 weeks me 1.8+ million torrent downloads cross kiye — yeh cross-border piracy aur popularity ko dikhata hai. Drishyam 3 (Ajay Devgn) production floors par hai. Vidya Balan Akshay Kumar ki upcoming film me ek major female lead hain. Diljit Dosanjh aur Imtiaz Ali ki period love story bhi confirmed hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Misc updates: Invincible x Spider-Man comic reprint 4 March 2026 ko ayega. Robert Pattinson aur Zendaya ki The Drama ka first trailer out hai — release 3 April 2026. Street Fighter, The Odyssey, Dune aur other franchises ke updates ne online discussions garam kar diye hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yeh thi aaj ki sabse badi pop-culture khabrein, hinglish style me. Agar chaho to main in me se kisi ek story par deep-dive, analysis, ya video script bhi bana dunga — batao kaunsi story pe detail chahiye. Comments me share karo — kaunsi news ne aapko sabse zyada excite ya shock kiya?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aakhri baat — pop culture ab sirf films tak simit nahi raha; streaming deals, global distribution aur digital platforms jaise YouTube se industry model hi badal raha hai. Ye changes creators aur audiences dono ke liye opportunities aur challenges lekar aate hain. Agar aap chaho toh main kisi bhi story par ek detailed analysis ya comparison likh kar de sakta hoon — bataiye kaunsa topic chahiye.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/hollywood-se-bollywood-tak-space-movie.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-1124649557391733376</guid><pubDate>Sun, 21 Dec 2025 08:36:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-03-12T02:24:00.360+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">action/fantasy</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">hollywood</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">papular movies 2025</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">top international film</category><title>Avatar 3: Fire and Ash — Review (No Spoilers)</title><description>&lt;p&gt;To guru… main &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Avatar+3+Fire+and+Ash&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Avatar: Fire and Ash&lt;/a&gt; dekhne gaya tha. Sach bolu toh main &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Avengers+Dooms+Day+trailer&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Avengers Dooms Day&lt;/a&gt; ka trailer dekhne ka zyada excited tha, lekin waha Steve Rogers ke jo leaked glimpses aaye, woh bhi mil gaye. Lekin woh topic main already kai baar cover kar chuka hoon.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;So chaliye shanti se Avatar 3 ke bare me hi baat karte hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Avatar 3: Fire and Ash, &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=James+Cameron+movies&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;James Cameron&lt;/a&gt; ki sabse ambitious film ka third part hai. Yeh ek aur engrossing cinematic experience deti hai, jo miss karna bilkul bhi nahi chahiye.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yahi woh movie hai jiske liye theatres bane hai.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yahi woh film hai jiske liye &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=3D+movie+technology&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;3D&lt;/a&gt; bana tha.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aur &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=IMAX+movie+experience&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IMAX&lt;/a&gt; ka asli potential bhi yahi movie justify karti hai.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Visually… ek technical cinematic excellence.&lt;br /&gt;Agar aap max experience chahte ho toh market me abhi koi competent movie iske level ki nahi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Movie me aise moments hai jaha aap literally uski beauty me kho jaate ho. Aisa feel hota hai ki bhai… &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Pandora+Avatar+world&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pandora&lt;/a&gt; ka one-way ticket katwaunga.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Story &amp;amp; Screenplay&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Story ki baat karein toh… it’s fine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thoda personality-less feel hota hai.&lt;br /&gt;Noble hai, important thoughts explore karti hai—&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nature&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Human Greed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Moral dilemma&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Heritage ka respect&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Like ek simple flowing river jise dekh ke hi peace milta hai.&lt;br /&gt;Simplicity apne aap volume bol deti hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lekin… koi bahut zyada memorable ya mind-blowing twist nahi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Plot Without Spoilers&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Avatar+2+The+Way+of+Water&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Avatar 2&lt;/a&gt; ke events ke baad &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Jake+Sully+character&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Jake Sully&lt;/a&gt; aur uski family water clan ke saath do life jee rahe hai—&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;ek Na’vi way&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;ek Jake Sully way&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Woh janta hai ki culture aur belief strength dete hai… lekin war jeetne ke liye weapons chahiye.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trailer me ek important point tha—&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Spider+character+Avatar&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Spider&lt;/a&gt; ka human biology ke saath Pandora pe survive karna.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Humans usse use karna chahte hai taaki Pandora ko aur colonize kar sake.&lt;br /&gt;Aur wahi ek major conflict create karta hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Varang+Avatar+character&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Varang&lt;/a&gt; naam ka ek character… bhai!&lt;br /&gt;For me, she was my favourite.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Uski smooth movement, chaos towards curiosity, aur Colonel ke saath uska dynamic… &lt;em&gt;damn!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur CGI eyes me jo internal conflict dikhaya gaya… mind-blowing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjECnKxbgFaBp3ryPDpsLkIEF307Tf96ynAyjE6qjXWN3rI2BMnNU-YgozAc1tL5pjbviKIoEl5jSoxpSZFwNYF24YvPyOLh4zX6NnIsYiGTk2PIKuub7WTSvBGCmkvVjN3o4wKtPxystly2_nGQyHLIyic9Tt3TkfUi3CVRivfxKxEvBad3puZDE37AMI/s1080/MV5BZDYxY2I1OGMtN2Y4MS00ZmU1LTgyNDAtODA0MzAyYjI0N2Y2XkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_FMjpg_UX1000_.jpg&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;607&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1080&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjECnKxbgFaBp3ryPDpsLkIEF307Tf96ynAyjE6qjXWN3rI2BMnNU-YgozAc1tL5pjbviKIoEl5jSoxpSZFwNYF24YvPyOLh4zX6NnIsYiGTk2PIKuub7WTSvBGCmkvVjN3o4wKtPxystly2_nGQyHLIyic9Tt3TkfUi3CVRivfxKxEvBad3puZDE37AMI/s16000/MV5BZDYxY2I1OGMtN2Y4MS00ZmU1LTgyNDAtODA0MzAyYjI0N2Y2XkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_FMjpg_UX1000_.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Emotional Touch&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Movie me ek scene par main sach me emotional ho gaya.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pichli movie me &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Tulkun+Avatar+creatures&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=1124649557391733376&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tulkun&lt;/a&gt; scene ne rula diya tha.&lt;br /&gt;Is baar bhi tears aa hi gaye.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;James Cameron ka cinema magic &lt;strong&gt;still works&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You feel —&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;loss&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;grief&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;family bond&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur woh classic storytelling ki warmth… clearly visible.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Visuals vs Story&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Visuals = MASTERPIECE&lt;br /&gt;Story = Traditional &amp;amp; simple&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ye ek highway jaise hai—&lt;br /&gt;world-class expressway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agar us par tuta-phuta scooter chalaya toh potential waste.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;James Cameron us expressway par Ferrari le aate hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ticket price, popcorn, long queues… sab justify ho jaate hain when you immerse into Pandora.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Final Verdict&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Visual experience = MUST WATCH (in theatres)&lt;br /&gt;Story = Fine, classic, but not groundbreaking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lekin…&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cinematic experience ke liye&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3D aur IMAX ke true potential ke liye&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YE movie theatre me dekhni hi chahiye.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;James Cameron ne phir se prove kar diya—&lt;br /&gt;agar cinema banana hai, toh is level par banao.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mujhe movie pasand aayi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur haan, agar aap movie dekh chuke ho toh apne thoughts mujhe comments me zaroor batao.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Till then…&lt;br /&gt;keep watching and keep exploring.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;div&gt;9/10 - banger&lt;/div&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/avatar-3-fire-and-ash-review-no-spoilers.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjECnKxbgFaBp3ryPDpsLkIEF307Tf96ynAyjE6qjXWN3rI2BMnNU-YgozAc1tL5pjbviKIoEl5jSoxpSZFwNYF24YvPyOLh4zX6NnIsYiGTk2PIKuub7WTSvBGCmkvVjN3o4wKtPxystly2_nGQyHLIyic9Tt3TkfUi3CVRivfxKxEvBad3puZDE37AMI/s72-c/MV5BZDYxY2I1OGMtN2Y4MS00ZmU1LTgyNDAtODA0MzAyYjI0N2Y2XkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_FMjpg_UX1000_.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-3331739933820498798</guid><pubDate>Sat, 13 Dec 2025 08:04:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-01-13T23:20:43.105+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">blog</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">mix</category><title>Dhundhar Box Office Collection: Ranveer Singh ka Dhamakedaar Comeback!</title><description>&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Introduction: Dhundhar ne Box Office par laga di aag!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bhaiyon, welcome back! Aap log dhundhar jo box office par aag laga di hai! Ranveer Singh jinka time accha nahi chal raha tha, 100% comeback ho gaya guaranteed! Lekin hai na Ranveer Singh ne jo kaand kiya - &quot;Kantara wala&quot; aur main bhi kuch log keh rahe the ki hype utni nahi hai, movie opening nahi le sakti, &quot;falana dhimkana&quot;!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Day 1 Performance: Expectations se zyada ki dhamal&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pehle din dhundhar ne actually apne expectations se zyada perform kiya hai! 28 crore net collection karke. Pehle kaha ja raha tha ki 20 tak pahunch jaaye to accha hoga, wahan se 28 chali gayi. Very good evening ke shows ne kaafi zyada pickup kiya, jiske kaaran dhundhar ka yeh day 1 hai wah 2025 ka third biggest hai for any Hindi movie.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sabse upar Vicky Kaushal ki &quot;Chhava&quot; baithti hai 31 crore ke saath. Phir uske baad Hrithik Roshan ki &quot;War 2&quot; jisne 29 crore kamaye the Hindi mein aur phir yeh 28 pe dhundhar.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjh9bphPlQdXuqQ3jc26xH5svY5qIQWPkIscT62RUyWPEsdjQfVJ6h2c1dJbdCjhjETf_PWaL1hV99TlKQXqzrY2rE7aW5wg_oxh7IkgKZL2fw9wNjpad-1z8g4pFSu6yjj532N_Xs0rVBW7i9F7Zbcc3YiHXmwW44DHTMQKX8gANQu5X6s1PRlb3GFt18/s1280/Your%20paragraph%20text%20(3).jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;720&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1280&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjh9bphPlQdXuqQ3jc26xH5svY5qIQWPkIscT62RUyWPEsdjQfVJ6h2c1dJbdCjhjETf_PWaL1hV99TlKQXqzrY2rE7aW5wg_oxh7IkgKZL2fw9wNjpad-1z8g4pFSu6yjj532N_Xs0rVBW7i9F7Zbcc3YiHXmwW44DHTMQKX8gANQu5X6s1PRlb3GFt18/s16000/Your%20paragraph%20text%20(3).jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Ranveer Singh ke Career par Dhundhar ka Impact&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yeh movie Ranveer Singh ke career par jo kaamal kar rahi hai na, uska andaza dilane ke liye maine Ranveer Singh ki pichli char movies ke collections uthaye jismein vo main lead role kar rahe the. Vo &quot;Suryavanshi&quot; aur vo &quot;falana nimagna&quot;, &quot;Singham Wingam&quot; nahi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lockdown ke baad se jo unki kismat badli hai na, vo ab tum ek saath dekhoge. Char movies kaun-koun si?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. 83&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2. Jayeshbhai Jordaar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3. Circus&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4. Rocky Rani Ki Prem Kahani&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jismein agar hum log neeche se chale to unki lowest performing Jayeshbhai Jordaar ka lifetime collection. Us movie ne apne pure run mein jitna kamaya tha na, usse zyada paisa dhundhar ne pehle din kamaya ek din mein!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Phir Rohit Shetty ke saath &quot;Circus&quot; jo movie banai thi usne apne opening weekend teen din ka total jitna kamaya hai na, usse zyada dhundhar ne kamaya again ek din mein. Circus ka total hai 21 crore, dhundhar ne 28 kiye hain aur issi circus ka lifetime collection usne 2 din mein paar kar liya.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Weekend Performance aur Comparison&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Iske baad thoda upar badhe to do movies bach jaati hain - 83 aur Rocky Rani Ki Prem Kahani. In dono ka opening weekend total pehle teen din ka total jitna hai na - 43-44 crore nahi actually 45 hai, utna isne ek din mein again phir se kamaya apne pehle Sunday pe. To tum samajh rahe ho ekdam se waqt, haalaat, jazbaat kaise badle hain ki [music] wahan teen din ka total aur yahan picture ek din mein match kar rahi hai!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur yahi jo uska Sunday wala number hai na, vo dekh kar meri aankhein khul gayi ki bhai yeh hota hai jump! Day number 1 pe aapne 28 crore kamaye. Phir Saturday ko badke vo 32 ho gaya bina kisi chhutti ke. Aur phir 32 se badke vo Sunday ko 43 crore ho gaya hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Comparison with 2025 ki Badi Movies&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Is performance is jump ke baad main pehle soch raha tha ki accha is movie ka comparison mujhe karna hoga. Is saali ki agar tum top 10 movies utha ke dekhoge to beech mein jo lot aata hai &quot;Housefull 5&quot;, &quot;Red 2&quot; ki unke mukable picture kitna kamayi hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;200 crore jaayegi nahi jaayegi, bahut acchi chal gayi to 250. Lekin yeh Sunday wale jump ne actually kaafi zyada possibilities khol di hai picture ke liye. Us 43 crore ke kaaran yeh ab middle wale pack se compare nahi hogi, balki 2025 ki biggest Indian movies top two pe jo baithi hui hai &quot;Chhava&quot; aur &quot;Sayara&quot; se comparison hoga.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sayara tumko pata hai kitni zyada viral chal rahi thi. Log paagal ho rahe the. Usne paisa bhi mota kamaya hai bhai. Aur Ranveer Singh ki is movie ne usko har din beat kiya hai vo bhi 67-67 crore ke margin se par day, jiske kaaran opening weekend ka total Sayara ka 83 crore hai aur dhundhar ka 103.20 crore aage hai vo usse haan. Lekin 103 jaane ke baad bhi vo Chhava ko nahi touch kar payi hai, vo usse abhi bhi 13 crore [music] aage chal rahi hai 116 pe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Monday Performance aur Future Predictions&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur yahi theme tum is poori video mein dekhne wale ho - pehla Monday ka number jab mere saamne aaya na, vo dekhkar aur bhi zyada shoori hui ki dhundhar is here to stay aur long run mein kaafi accha paisa kamane wali hai. Kyunki kyunki vo again hold ke maamle mein normal working day ke collections mein Chhava aur Sayara ke level par bani hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jahan un dono purani movies ne 24-4 crore kamaye the, dhundhar almost ussi league mein hai 23-24 ke aaspaas, jiska matlab tum samjho ki is movie ka pehla Monday working day koi chhutti nahi, koi discount wagarah offer nahi. Phir bhi vo Friday ka almost match kar jaata hai, which is actually very commendable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Lifetime Collection Predictions&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jab tak hum log dhundhar ke lifetime end collection ki baat karein to abhi pehle chaar din ka total vo Sayara se 20 crore aage hai. Aur yahan se usko bas caution match karne. Sayara ne jo par day kamaya tha agar utna hi kamayi hai to 350 crore India net collection dhundhar ka ja sakta hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lekin yahan par main batata hun tum note karke le lo apna pehla Thursday. Day number seven aate-aate agar movie 20 crore ke neeche nahi jaati consistently 20 ke upar vo kam rahi hai aur uske baad jo weekend aayega iske saamne Friday, Saturday Sunday. Usmein agar isne phir se 40 crore ka aankda touch liya.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Note kar rahe ho tum log day number 10 jo iska wapas [music] se Sunday aane wala hai, usmein agar isne 40 crore ka aankda touch kiya hai bhai to main batata hun jo hum log 350 EM kar rahe hain na picture 550 se pehle nahi rukne wali Hindi language mein. Vo 550 crore chali jaayegi agar vo Sunday day number 10 pe 40 se zyada kamayi hai to. Aur ho sakta hai ki vo Chhava ko bhi challenge kare number one spot ke liye.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Impact on Other Movies&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lekin is movie ne ek doosri love story ko definitely bahut bada nuksaan pahunchaya - &quot;Tere Ishq Mein&quot;. Jahan usne apne pehle Sunday pe almost 20 crore kam liya tha. Doosre Sunday pe picture jitna traction dikh rahi thi vo uske aaspaas ja sakti thi 12-15 crore kar sakti thi. 10 bhi ho jaata to bhi matlab ek downgrade hi maante.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lekin dhundhar ka itna magic chala tha na ki sirf 7 crore kamaye. &quot;Tere Ishq Mein&quot; ka saara market kha gayi vo. Aur iske kaaran 11 din ka total hone ke baad vo ab 102 crore pe hai. Uska par day ab 2 crore ki range mein aa chuka hai. To aisa maan ke chalo ki mota-mota vo 120-130 tak jaayegi. Jahan lag raha tha ki &quot;Tere Ishq Mein&quot; could go up to 150-160-170 Hindi. Dekh rahe ho kitna chhota kar diya.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Future of Dhundhar Franchise&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ab yeh hoga ya nahi hoga vo to ap log agle business report ke episode [music] mein definitely dekhenge. Lekin is baat ki almost guarantee maan lo ki 2025 ki highest grossing jo Hindi movies hain jo Hindi mein bani hai picture usmein abhi number one pe Chhava hai jisne 590 crore kamaye the almost nahi actually 585 hai net collection aur number two pe aati hai Sayara jisne 329.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To gap kaafi zyada hai dono ke beech mein, wahan par jaake yeh fit baithne wali hai jo ki tum socho kitna zyada impressive fit kahoge picture 3 ghante ki hai, PVR INOX mein add wagarah mila ke vo log 4 ghanta kheench dete hain to iska matlab par day vo log zyada zyada shows nahi laga sakte. Chaar-chaar ghante tak agar ek chal raha hai to number of shows kam ho gaye. Upar se ek 18+ movie hai jiske andar brutality dikhayi hai, blood dikhaya hua, violence dikhaya hua. To dil ki kamzor audience vaisi hi kam ho gayi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Itna hone ke baad bhi picture agar 350-400 chali jaati hai to bahut impressive feel bhai bahut zyada. Aur main wahi keh raha hun ki agar part one ne itna kiya hai na to imagine karo part two kitna karega! Kyunki yeh log jo isko 350-400 kamake denge vo pehle se tipe rahein ge bhai. Opening utni badi karwayenge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is a big fat possibility ki jab iska part two release ho to uska day number 1 50 crore to chhod do 60-70 crore bhi le sakta hai Hindi net mein!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Conclusion: Dhundhar ka Magic aur Future Scope&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;To haan dhundhar ne kaafi impressive fit kiya hai aur jis tarike se social media pe iska trend mujhe aate hue dikh raha hai na, jo maine dekha ki Monday raat ka show IMAX mein almost full hai. Mujhe nahi lag rahi picture aaspaas mein kahin rukne wali hai. Craze iska yahan se aur badhte hi jaayega. Log jitna zyada baat karenge, jitna zyada divided honge wahi &quot;Animal&quot; wala effect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bhai December mahina to ab ek woh soni murgi ban chuki hai. Pichle 3 saalon mein consistently usne blockbusters diye hain, all time blockbusters diye hain. Animal, phir Pushpa 2, ab dhundhar.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur iske baare mein main yeh kehna chahunga ki main yahan par ek kaafi wild claim tumhaare saamne rakhna chahunga jo main bhi galat ho sakta hai. Lekin jo main andar se feel kar raha hun na is movie ko leke aur doosri baar dekhte waqt mujhe bilkul bhi nahi laga ki main 3 ghante ki picture dekh raha hun. Bahut lambi hai, bor ho raha hai nahi. Second time yeh aur bhi utni zyada engaging hai. Iski politics aur bhi utni zyada acche se samajh mein aati hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Repeat watching definitely dhundhar hold karti hai. Aur uske kaaran I feel ki pehle 10 din ka collection dhundhar ke pehle 10 din ka collection 300 crore ja sakta hai. Worst case scenario to hum log consider nahi karenge. Ek good middle case scenario hai ki uska lifetime 300-350 tak jaaye aur ekdam best case scenario hai ki 10 din mein hi vo 300 crore ka aankda paar kar. Let&#39;s see wah sach mein hota hai ya nahi hota hai. Dekhenge agli video mein.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tab tak tum Odu ko dekho. Link description mein hai. Mera yeh video kaisa laga definitely batana. Instagram pe follow kar sakte ho. Sehat ka dhyaan rakho. Milte hain agli baar. Tata bye-bye jao.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/dhundhar-box-office-collection-ranveer.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjh9bphPlQdXuqQ3jc26xH5svY5qIQWPkIscT62RUyWPEsdjQfVJ6h2c1dJbdCjhjETf_PWaL1hV99TlKQXqzrY2rE7aW5wg_oxh7IkgKZL2fw9wNjpad-1z8g4pFSu6yjj532N_Xs0rVBW7i9F7Zbcc3YiHXmwW44DHTMQKX8gANQu5X6s1PRlb3GFt18/s72-c/Your%20paragraph%20text%20(3).jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-2254524458797360339</guid><pubDate>Sat, 13 Dec 2025 07:47:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-03-12T02:27:09.527+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">blog</category><title>Top 9 South Indian Suspense Movies: Aapke Dimaag Ghuma Denge!</title><description>
    &lt;blockquote&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;&quot;Report karti hai ki &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Satyabhama+serial+killer&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2254524458797360339&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;serial killer&lt;/a&gt; ne unka balatkar karke ma*r daala.&quot;&lt;br /&gt;
        &quot;Koi nahi jaanta ki un 16 ladkiyon ka sirf kya hai.&quot;&lt;br /&gt;
        &quot;Ye bhi nahi pata ki woh kaise dikhti thi.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/blockquote&gt;

