&quot;Tumhari duniya ka ant aa gaya hai.&quot;&lt;br /&gt;
&quot;Hum uska saamna milkar karenge. Milkar use se ladenge.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Agar aap bhi apne free time mein ek aisi Hollywood movie dekhna chahte ho jiske andar aapko action, adventure, science fiction, horror, fantasy jaise chezein dekhne ko mile, toh aaj ki ye video aapke liye hai. Kyunki aaj ki is list mein main aapko Hollywood ki top 9 best movies ke baare mein batane wala hoon, jinhe aapko ek baar toh zaroor dekhna chahiye. Aur sabse achhi baat ye hai ki saari hi movies aapko high-quality Hindi dubbing ke saath dekhne ko milegi. Isi liye video ko bina skip ke end tak zaroor dekhna.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Toh chaliye, bin kisi deri ke shuru karte hain!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgksq1h-MUrpSqmXc88OAHp9oIUwyd4QHNVmlH_kXYmeMBe3a3i_MW6Rlh8Bc8PPTj6MSOSilU0eWXRaoYY_au90a6JFT5yl5vWCTJTkqSoURjy7mfhf0lVzus4vb6hSBuivIeabTHxIhDNkV9KChLkmaUi3EujBUXRMPRfqElPyMU2sHD_E0QnizRbTM4=s756&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;425&quot; data-original-width=&quot;756&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgksq1h-MUrpSqmXc88OAHp9oIUwyd4QHNVmlH_kXYmeMBe3a3i_MW6Rlh8Bc8PPTj6MSOSilU0eWXRaoYY_au90a6JFT5yl5vWCTJTkqSoURjy7mfhf0lVzus4vb6hSBuivIeabTHxIhDNkV9KChLkmaUi3EujBUXRMPRfqElPyMU2sHD_E0QnizRbTM4=s16000&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Number 9: Final Kill (2018)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ek bahut hi kaam ki movie jiska naam hai &lt;strong&gt;Final Kill&lt;/strong&gt;. Ye 2018 mein release hui ek action thriller movie hai jise &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=IMDb+movie+ratings&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=6378035393872177784&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IMDb&lt;/a&gt; ki taraf se 5.8 out of 10 ki rating mili hui hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahani:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar humein story dikhai jaati hai Michael naam ke ek soldier ki jiske ek karibi friend ki death ho jaati hai. Aur aise mein Michael apne friend ki death ke baad decide karta hai ki voh uski family ka dhyan rakhega. Ab aise mein ek din Michael uski friend ki beti Danny ke saath ek football match dekhne ke liye jaata hai. Lekin wahan pe jaane ke baad achanak se kuch bahut hi khatarnak terrorists us football ground ke upar attack kar dete hain. Aur isi wajah se ye terrorists poore football ground ko apne andar le lete hain. Ab aise mein Michael jo ki yahan pe phas chuka hai, aur aise mein Michael kaise bhi karke yahan se bahar nikalna chahta hai taaki voh apne aap ki aur apne friend ki beti ki jaan bacha sake. Lekin ab yahan se bachke nikalna itna bhi aasaan nahi hone wala, kyunki agar Michael ko yahan se bachke nikalna hai toh use un saare terrorists ko khatam karna hoga. Toh aakhir kya Michael un saare terrorists ka saamna karke yahan se bach nikal payega aur aakhir kya Michael apne aap ki aur apne friend ki beti ki jaan bacha payega ya fir nahi? Wohi sab kahani jaanne ke liye aap is kaam ki action movie ko dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar aapko bahut hi kaam ke action scene dekhne ko mil jaayenge. Toh agar aap ek dhinchak non-stop action wali movie dekhna chahte ho toh ye movie aapke liye perfect rahegi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Number 8: 47 Meters Down (2019)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ye 2019 mein release hui ek horror thriller action movie hai jise IMDb ki taraf se 5 out of 10 ki rating mili hui hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahani:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar humein story dikhai jaati hai kuch teenagers ladkiyon ki jo ki ek din decide karti hain ki woh samandar ke neeche jaayengi taaki wahan pe jaakar woh hazaaron saal pehle doobe hue ek sheher ko explore kar sake. Ab aise mein ye log bina kuch soche samjhe us sheher ko explore karne ke liye samandar ke neeche chali jaati hain. Lekin wahan pe jaane ke baad achanak se ek bahut hi khatarnak &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=sharks+survival+thriller+movie&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=6378035393872177784&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;sharks&lt;/a&gt; in logon ke upar attack kar deti hain. Aur is shark attack ki wajah se ye log apna bahar nikalne ka raasta bhool jaate hain. Ab aise mein ye log yahan pe bahut buri situation mein phas chuke hain kyunki agar in logon ne yahan se bahar nikalne ki koshish kari toh woh shark in logon ko jaan maar degi. Toh aakhir kya ye log yahan pe survive payenge? Aur aakhir kya ye log yahan se zinda bahar nikal bhi payenge ya fir nahi? Wohi sab kahani jaanne ke liye aap is movie ko dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar aapko bahut hi kaam ka thriller experience milega. Agar aapko is tarah ki survival thriller movies dekhna pasand hai toh aap is movie ko bilkul bhi miss na karein. Aur agar aap is movie ko dekhna chahte ho toh filhaal ye movie aapko Hindi languages ke saath &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Prime+Video&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=6378035393872177784&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Prime Video&lt;/a&gt; pe dekhne ko mil jaayegi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Number 7: Mindtrap (2020)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ye 2020 mein release hui ek horror survival thriller movie hai jise IMDb ki taraf se 5.4 out of 10 ki rating mili hui hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahani:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar humein story dikhai jaati hai Lisa naam ki ek ladki ki jo ki ek jagah ke upar jaane ke liye travel kar rahi hoti hai. Lekin is beech achanak se Lisa wahan pe behosh ho jaati hai. Lekin jab Lisa ko hosh aata hai, woh dekhti hai ki woh ek bahut hi ajeeb si choti si jagah ke upar qaid ho chuki hai aur uske haathon pe bhi ek bahut hi ajeeb tarah ka gadget laga hua hai. Aur ye ek aisi jagah hai jahan se bahar nikalne ka bhi koi raasta nahi hai. Ab aise mein Lisa yahan se bahar nikalne ki bahut hi zyada koshish karti hai. Lekin iske bawjood bhi woh ghoom-pherke usi jagah ke upar waapas aa jaati hai aur upar se na toh yahan pe khaana hai na hi paani. Toh aakhir aisi situation mein Lisa yahan pe kaise survive karegi aur aakhir woh achanak se is jagah ke upar kaise pahunchi? Wohi sab kahani jaanne ke liye aap is movie ko dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Agar aap ek deadly survival thriller movie dekhna chahte ho toh ye movie aapke liye perfect rahegi. Aur filhaal aap is movie ko Hindi languages ke saath Prime Video pe dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Number 6: Stray Dogs (2011)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ye 2011 mein release hui ek action thriller movie hai jise IMDb ki taraf se 5.8 out of 10 ki rating mili hui hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahani:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar humein story dikhai jaati hai David naam ke ek aadmi ki jo ki apni wife ke saath apne hometown mein wapas jaata hai taaki wahan pe jaakar woh apne father ke purane ghar ko repair karwaake use bacha sake. Lekin wahan pe jaane ke baad achanak se kuch khatarnak log David aur uski wife ko pareshaan karne lag jaate hain aur dheere-dheere karke ye pareshaniyan itni zyada badh jaati hai jiski wajah se David aur uski wife ki jaan ko bhi khatra hone lag jaata hai. Toh aakhir David apni wife ko aur apne aap ko kaise bachayega aur aakhir woh saare khatarnak log David aur uski wife ko kyun maarna chahte hain? Wohi sab kahani jaanne ke liye aap is kaam ki action movie ko dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Abhale hi ye movie thodi si purani hai lekin movie ke andar aapko kaafi kaam ka thrill saath hi achhe khaase action scene dekhne ko mil jaayenge. Toh agar chaaho toh is movie ko one-time watch ke liye Prime Video pe dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Number 5: Jim Button and Luke the Engine Driver (2018)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ye 2018 mein release hui ek &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=action+adventure+fantasy+movies+list&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=6378035393872177784&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;action adventure fantasy movie&lt;/a&gt; hai jise IMDb ki taraf se 6.3 out of 10 ki rating mili hui hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahani:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar humein story dikhai jaati hai Jim aur Luke naam ke do aadmi ki jo ki ek chote se island ke upar rehte hain. Lekin aise mein unka island kisi bhi time doob sakta hai. Jiski wajah se woh nikal jaate hain apne island ko bachane ke liye. Lekin agar unhon apne doobe hue island ko bachana hai toh unhon ek mission ko poora karna hoga jahan pe unhon Raja ki beti yaani ki Rajkumari ko dhoondna hoga jo ki kuch time pehle gayab ho gayi thi. Aur ab aise mein Luke aur Jim nikal jaate hain ek adventure journey ke upar taaki woh Rajkumari ko dhoond sake. Toh aakhir kya Jim aur Luke milkar Rajkumari ko dhoond payenge? Aur aakhir Rajkumari achanak se kahan pe gayab hui thi? Aur aakhir unhon iske adventure journey ke beech mein unhon kin-kin problems ka saamna karna pada? Wohi sab kahani jaanne ke liye aap is kaam ki movie ko dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Agar aapko is tarah ki fantasy wali movies dekhna pasand hai aur agar aapne is movie ko nahi dekha toh main aapko highly recommend karunga ki aap is movie ko bilkul bhi miss na karein. Aur agar aap is movie ko dekhna chahte ho toh ye movie aapko Hindi languages ke saath Prime Video, JioHotstar saath hi MX Player ke upar dekhne ko mil jaayegi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Number 4: Mercedes Land (2023)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ye 2023 mein release hui ek action adventure movie hai jise IMDb ki taraf se 5.7 out of 10 ki rating mili hui hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahani:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar humein story dikhai jaati hai hamare future world ki jo ki kisi reason ki wajah se destroy ho chuki hai aur is wajah se insaano ki aadhi se bhi zyada population khatam ho chuki hai. Ab is beech humein story dikhai jaati hai ek single mother aur uski beti ki jo ki kisi tarah yahan pe survive karne ki koshish karti hai aur aise mein ye mother apni beti ke saath ek aisi jagah pe jaana chahti hai jahan pe jaakar woh apni beti ke saath bilkul hi safe reh sake. Lekin is beech kahani mein twist aata hai jab achanak se kuch bahut hi khatarnak log is mother aur uski beti ke peeche pad jaate hain unhein maane ke liye. Toh aakhir ye mother aakhir apne aap ko aur apni beti ko kaise bachayegi aur aakhir woh saare log inn donon ko kyun maarna chahte hain aur aakhir hamara earth kaise destroy hua? Wohi sab kahani jaanne ke liye aap is kaam ki movie ko dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Ho sakta hai mein se kuch logon ko ye movie bilkul hi boring lage. Lekin agar aapko meri tarah slow base wali movies dekhna pasand hai toh ye movie aapko pasand aayegi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Number 3: Need for Speed (2014)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ye 2014 mein release hui ek action thriller movie hai jise IMDb ki taraf se 6.4 out of 10 ki rating mili hui hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahani:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar humein story dikhai jaati hai Tobey naam ke ek &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=street+racer+movies&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=6378035393872177784&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;street racer&lt;/a&gt; ki jiske ek friend ki ek din racing ke chalte maut ho jaati hai. Lekin baad mein jaakar Tobey ko pata chalta hai ki asal mein ye koi normal maut nahi thi balki uske friend ko kisi ne jaan-bujhke maara hai. Aur ab aise mein Tobey decide karta hai ki voh kaise bhi karke apne friend ki maut ka badla lega. Toh aakhir kya Tobey apne friend ki maut ka badla lega aur is beech movie ke andar jo kuch bhi kaam ke kar action scene vagaireh hone waale hain woh sab jaanne ke liye aap is movie ko dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Agar aapko car racing wali movies dekhna pasand hai. Agar aapko &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Fast+and+Furious+franchise&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=6378035393872177784&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;fast and furious&lt;/a&gt; jaisi movies dekhna pasand hai jiske andar aapko car racing wale scenes dekhne ko mile toh ye movie aapke liye perfect rahegi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Number 2: Infection (2019)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ye 2019 mein release hui ek action thriller survival movie hai jise IMDb ki taraf se 5.1 out of 10 ki rating mili hui hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahani:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar humein story dikhai jaati hai hamare earth ki jahan pe achanak se ek bahut hi khatarnak &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=zombie+virus+in+movies&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=6378035393872177784&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;zombie virus&lt;/a&gt; fail jaata hai. Ab is beech humein story dikhai jaati hai ek father ki jo ki kaise bhi karke apne bete ko is zombie virus se infected hone se bachana chahta hai. Toh aakhir ye father apne bete ko bachane ke liye kya karega? Aur aakhir kya ye father apne aap ko aur apne bete ko un khatarnak zombies se bacha payega? Aur aakhir ye zombie virus achanak se kahan se faila? Wohi sab kahani jaanne ke liye aap is movie ko dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Agar aap zombie movies dekhna pasand hai toh aap is movie ko zaroor dekhein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Number 1: Policestation Lockdown (2013)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ye 2013 mein release hui ek action thriller movie hai jise IMDb ki taraf se 5.9 out of 10 ki rating mili hui hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahani:&lt;/strong&gt; Is movie ke andar humein story dikhai jaati hai Johnny naam ke ek police officer ki jiski beti ek din usey ek club mein bulati hai taaki wahan pe woh uske boyfriend se milwa sake. Ab aise mein Johnny apni beti ke boyfriend se milne ke liye us club ke andar chala jaata hai. Lekin wahan pe jaane ke baad achanak se kuch bahut hi khatarnak log wahan pe aa jaate hain aur woh log Johnny aur uski beti ko &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=kidnap+plot+movies&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=6378035393872177784&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;kidnap&lt;/a&gt; kar dete hain. Ab aise mein Johnny jo ki kaise bhi karke apni beti ko bachana chahta hai. Toh aakhir kya Johnny apni beti ko bacha payega aur aakhir usey kisne aur kyun kidnap kiya hai? Wohi sab kahani jaanne ke liye aap is kaam ki movie ko dekh sakte ho.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Agar aap koi aisi movie dekhna chahte ho jiske andar aapko starting se lekar end tak action scenes dekhne ko mile toh ye movie aapke liye perfect rahegi. Aur filhaal ye movie aapko Hindi languages ke saath Prime Video saathi MX Player ke upar dekhne ko mil jaayegi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Toh chaliye doston iske saath hamari aaj ki blog ko yahin khatm karte hain. Milte hain kisi nayi aur interesting blog ke saath. Tab tak ke liye, take care, bye-bye.&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/top-9-hollywood-movies-in-hindi-aapke.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgksq1h-MUrpSqmXc88OAHp9oIUwyd4QHNVmlH_kXYmeMBe3a3i_MW6Rlh8Bc8PPTj6MSOSilU0eWXRaoYY_au90a6JFT5yl5vWCTJTkqSoURjy7mfhf0lVzus4vb6hSBuivIeabTHxIhDNkV9KChLkmaUi3EujBUXRMPRfqElPyMU2sHD_E0QnizRbTM4=s72-c" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-2369532437263033253</guid><pubDate>Sat, 13 Dec 2025 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-09-08T01:59:33.928+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">blog</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">mix</category><title>Top 10 Mind-Bending Suspense Movies: OTT Par Dhoondhne Ki Zarurat Nahi, Main Le Aaya!</title><description>&lt;p&gt;Bhai log, OTT par itna kachra bhara hai ki 10 movie dekho, usmein se ek achchi nikalti hai. Lekin tension mat lo, main poori duniya se chun-chunke aapke liye 10 aisi suspense movies laya hoon jo aapke dimag ke taale khol degi. Toh chaliye shuru karte hain top 10 mind suspense movies ka review!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjAq9DFlYElUj0qjUMjvBp1cmgB5g7JjlLg1lCCLXcEMh2ams34FYJNh6YcgPiPL6GjXU3mNgKSD38FzRRvix5nJEk7ecf4fP9HPI-UXm6FYFjhQA-3BZ5KYdRsnLtzWHjO0ltKCE3UEOfPjPCq0QZm4SVdNAcWxDCgtxi0033_IX5bCGO6oSUKBBeZeYs/s1280/Your%20paragraph%20text.jpg&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;720&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1280&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjAq9DFlYElUj0qjUMjvBp1cmgB5g7JjlLg1lCCLXcEMh2ams34FYJNh6YcgPiPL6GjXU3mNgKSD38FzRRvix5nJEk7ecf4fP9HPI-UXm6FYFjhQA-3BZ5KYdRsnLtzWHjO0ltKCE3UEOfPjPCq0QZm4SVdNAcWxDCgtxi0033_IX5bCGO6oSUKBBeZeYs/s16000/Your%20paragraph%20text.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 10: Bendecidos&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Number 10 pe hai ek aisa criminal jisne 59 banks ko loota. Haan, main repeat kar raha hoon, 59 bank! Apne charm aur costume ka istemaal karke yeh ek full-thriller but fun ride hai. Agar aap &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Catch+Me+If+You+Can&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Catch Me If You Can&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; ke fan hain, toh yeh movie zaroor pasand aayegi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMDb Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; 16,000 logon ne 6.4 ki average rating di hai.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Movie mein chezein thodi si repetitive lag sakti hain aur thodi si low-budget feel hogi, lekin quality hai bhai!&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahan Milegi:&lt;/strong&gt; Prime Video par Hindi mein available hai.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 9: Aaryan (2025)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Number 9 ki movie aapke dimag ke taale khol degi. Live television pe ek criminal apne aap ko goli maar deta hai... Arre, sorry sorry, ye writer hai! Aur bolta hai ki har din main ek aadmi ko marunga aur marne ke 1 ghante pehle tum logon ko uska naam bataunga. Dhoond ke dikhao saalo! Isse samjho &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Ratsasan&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Ratsasan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; aur &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Anjaam+Pathiraa&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Anjaam Pathiraa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; ka cocktail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Starting mein wohi typical South ki hero-heroine ki love story hai, usey thoda avoid karna. Baad mein suspense ek baar shuru ho gaya, toh aap sochte rehte hain ki sala ab kisko marega? Par maar kyun raha hai ye? Aur sabse bada sawaal: sala marne ke baad kaise maar raha hai?&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahan Milegi:&lt;/strong&gt; Tamil Industry se, Hindi mein Netflix par 2025 ki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 8: Barahmulla (2025)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Number 8 ki movie hai &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Asur&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Asur&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; aur &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Tumbbad&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tumbbad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; ka cocktail. Kashmir mein ek ke baad ek bachche gayab ho rahe hain. Police ise crime samajh rahi hai, lekin investigation karne ke baad jo socha tha, usse kuch aur hi nikalta hai. Main spoiler nahi dunga, lekin unexpected cinematography beautiful lekin haunting hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Jo supernatural element hai, woh bhi unique hai. Yeh woh ghisa-pita bhootiya kuch nahi. Bachche dabbon mein se jheel ke beech mein se gayab ho rahe hain, sab connected hai. Movie thodi si lambi feel sakti hai. Ending kisi ke liye masterpiece toh kisi ke liye ekdam bekaar. Lekin agar kuch hatke dekhna hai toh Bollywood se.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMDb Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; 8,000 logon ne 7 ki average IMDb rating di hai.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahan Milegi:&lt;/strong&gt; Netflix par 2025 ki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 7: RIEL&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Number 7 pe, kya aapko intelligence pai thriller pasand hai? Bahut hi underrated movie hai Amazon Prime par Hindi mein. 17,000 logon ne 7 ki average IMDb rating di hai. Ek bada corrupt corporation expose hone wala hai, aur jo whistle-blower hai, usey khatra hai. Usey protect karna padega. Ek aadmi kaise system ke naak mein dam kar deta hai, woh dekhne mein aapko maja aata hai. Yeh film mein aapko &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Naseeruddin+Shah+Wednesday&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Naseeruddin Shah&lt;/a&gt; ki &lt;strong&gt;Wednesday&lt;/strong&gt; wali vibe milegi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahan Milegi:&lt;/strong&gt; Amazon Prime par Hindi mein available hai.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 6: ICU&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Number 6 ki movie, bhai sahab, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Parasite&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Parasite&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; aur &lt;strong&gt;The Others&lt;/strong&gt; ko mix kar lo. Ek detective ke ghar mein kuch toh ajeeb-o-gareeb chezein ho rahi hain aur aapko lagta hai sala kahin bhoot-aatma, pret toh nahi hai. Lekin nahi bhai! Jo suspense khulega, main challenge karta hoon, aapne expect hi nahi kiya hoga. Aisa kuch dekhne milega. Lekin starting mein thoda sa sabr rakhna padega, sabr ka phal meetha nahi, amrit milega.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMDb Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; 75,000 logon ne 6.8 ki average rating di hai.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahan Milegi:&lt;/strong&gt; Horror thriller, Prime Video par Hindi mein available hai.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 5: The Bikeriders&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Is saal ki sabse underrated movie. Ek ex-baseball player jo bar tender hai, galati se ek chabi dhoond leta hai aur bina wajah Russian mob mein phas jaata hai. Uske baad shuru hota hai chaos. &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=90s+New+York&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;90s ka New York&lt;/a&gt; ka poora mahaul. Jo hero hai, &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Austin+Butler&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Austin Butler&lt;/a&gt;, kuch hai kya! Performance di hai bhai, sabse best. Movie ki non-stop thriller hai, saans lene ka bhi time nahi deti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMDb Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; 5,000 se 1,000 logon ne 6.9 ki average rating di hai.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Akeli dekhni padhegi movie. Brutal aur adult hai. Maja tab aata hai jab apne hero ki bhagm-bhag shuru hoti hai. Ekdam straight-forward comedy crime thriller.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 4: Thalapathi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Number 4 ki movie, apni biwiyon ko zaroor dikhana, taaki unko bhi pata chale ki patiyo ka dukh kya hota hai! Tamil industry ki Jio Hotstar par Hindi mein available hai. Husband aur wife mein ego clash ho jaata hai. Court mein talaak lene chale jaate hain. Ye husband-wife court mein ladh rahe hain, court ke bahar ladh rahe hain. Achha, unke jo dono advocates hain, woh bhi husband-wife hain, woh bhi ladh rahe hain. &quot;It&#39;s my choice! It&#39;s my choice! My choice!&quot; Mardon kaleje ko thandak pahunchayi hai is movie ne. Makers ko koti-koti pranam.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahan Milegi:&lt;/strong&gt; Jio Hotstar par Hindi mein available hai.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 3: Ezra (Brahmayugam)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Number 3 pe, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Brahma+Yugam&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Brahma Yugam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; aur &lt;strong&gt;Tum&lt;/strong&gt; ka cocktail. Ek aadmi apne purane ghar Kerala wapas aata hai. Wahan par purvajon ka shraap aur exorcism ki khatarnak history se takrata hai. Movie dheere-dheere start hoti hai aur fir peak pe jaati hai, aur phir aapki phat jaati hai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Pranav &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=Mohanlal+Malayalam+cinema&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Mohanlal&lt;/a&gt;. Bhai, yeh Mohanlal wale sare ache actors hote hain. Movie aapko aise ajeeb-o-gareeb creature, witch ya gor kuch dikhakar nahi darati hai. Aapko woh mahaul set karti hai pehle, aapko us mahaul mein leke jaati hai, aur phir aapko feel karwati hai ki ab kuch hoga, ab kuch hoga. Ye cheez mere ko bahut achchi lagti hai. Kisi ko slow lag sakti hai. Malayalam industry, bhai pagal hain ye log! Maine theatre mein nahi dekhi, badi galti ki. Finally Jio Hotstar par aa gayi hai.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahan Milegi:&lt;/strong&gt; Jio Hotstar par Hindi mein available hai.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 2: Eden&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O bhai sahab, is saal ki meri one of the favourite movie! Isne mere life ko dekhne ka sala nazariya badal diya, meri soch badal di. Kuch log duniya chhod kar world war chhod kar ek island par society banane jaate hain. Lekin us island par jitni khatarnaak nature hai, usse double-trouble, 10 guna zyada khatarnaak insaan ki fitrat hai. Survival kaise madness mein turn hota hai, ye aap dekhoge. Mereko yeh dekhkar &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=The+Beach&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;The Beach&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; movie yaad aayi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Movie bahut zyada adult hai. Hindi mein Prime Video par available hai. Ending thodi si ajeeb-o-gareeb hai. Bahut hi kam 6.5 ki average IMDb rating hai. Mere liye nine on ten hai ye movie.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahan Milegi:&lt;/strong&gt; Prime Video par Hindi mein available hai.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Number 1: Frankenstein&#39;s Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Number 1 pe ek yedra scientist jo ek laash ke andar jaan daalne ke experiment mein ek creature ko jinda karta hai. Emotional, lekin aapko andar se hila dene wala climax hai iska. Movie cinematically itni khoobsurat hai ki aapko lagega main koi Oscar level ki movie dekh raha hoon Netflix par.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaisi Hai:&lt;/strong&gt; Bhai, movie bahut zyada dark hai. Andhere mein dekhna padega kyunki kuch dikhayega hi nahi aapko light mein. Ek point pe thodi si slow, artistic aur Oscar-type ki ho jaati hai. Lekin aaj ke &lt;a data-preview=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;amp;q=AI+era+practical+effects&amp;amp;bbid=1056021179195438855&amp;amp;bpid=2369532437263033253&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI ke jamane&lt;/a&gt; mein jis tarah se practical effects dikhaye gaye hain, aapko visual masterpiece lagegi is saal ki.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMDb Rating:&lt;/strong&gt; Around 1.5 lakh logon ne 7.6 ki average rating di hai.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kahan Milegi:&lt;/strong&gt; Netflix par available hai.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/top-10-mind-bending-suspense-movies-ott.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjAq9DFlYElUj0qjUMjvBp1cmgB5g7JjlLg1lCCLXcEMh2ams34FYJNh6YcgPiPL6GjXU3mNgKSD38FzRRvix5nJEk7ecf4fP9HPI-UXm6FYFjhQA-3BZ5KYdRsnLtzWHjO0ltKCE3UEOfPjPCq0QZm4SVdNAcWxDCgtxi0033_IX5bCGO6oSUKBBeZeYs/s72-c/Your%20paragraph%20text.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-7401639783831811466</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Dec 2025 16:32:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2025-12-12T22:02:38.211+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">blog</category><title>SuperGirl Teaser Breakdown: Kya Hai James Gunn Ka Naya DCU Magic!</title><description>&lt;p&gt;To dosto, finally SuperGirl ka teaser aa chuka hai aur main toh bilkul excited hoon! Jahan humein movie ke almost sabhi main characters dikha diye gaye hain, par saath mein humein pehli jhalak mili hai James Gunn ke DCU ke Krypton ki. Aur aapko shayad yeh jaankar hairani hogi ki DCU mein Krypton ka ant Man of Steel ke ant se bahut alag hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Women of Tomorrow Se Inspiration&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wahi mere liye sabse zyada exciting baat yeh hai ki is teaser mein dikhne wale nazare bilkul page by page inspiration lag rahe hain Women of Tomorrow comic book se. Aur finally humein dikha Jason Momoa ka logo. Toh aaj hum breakdown kar rahe hain SuperGirl ke teaser trailer ka jahan main aapko woh saari detail batane wala hoon jo aapse miss ho gaye hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Teaser ki shururat hoti hai is scene se jahan hum dekhte hain ki Krypto ek bottle ko dhakkar gira deta hai. Ab dekhne toh yeh saaf pata chal raha hai ki yeh koi sharab ki bottle hai. Par us bottle ke girne se vinyl record bajna shuru hota hai. Ab yahan pe humein ek classic James Gunn touch zaroor dikh raha hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;James Gunn ki aksar yeh aadat hai ki woh apni movie mein background music dalne ka bhi ek tarika dhundte hain. Jaise Guardians of the Galaxy movies mein woh ya toh Peter ka Walkman hota tha ya phir uske ship par laga hua surround sound system. Toh teekh is tarah is vinyl record player ke neeche ek speaker rakha hai jo bajna shuru hota hai aur jo gaana yahan play ho raha hai woh hai &quot;Call Me&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Krypton Ka Naya Roop&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ab agle hi scene mein hum dekh sakte hain ki zameen par ek newspaper pada hua hai jo ki Daily Planet ka hi paper hai. Iske front page par do khabrein chhapi hui hain. Ek jahan par likha hua hai ki &quot;Superman Saves The Town From Nuclear Explosion&quot;. Wahi doosri taraf kaafi chhote slot mein likha hua hai &quot;SuperGirl Rescues Cats&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yahan fun element yeh hai ki Superman ka picture kaafi bada aur kaafi smiling face wala hai. Wahi SuperGirl apni picture mein kaafi poker face ke saath dikh rahi hai. Par yeh scene humein yeh idea bhi de deta hai ki apne cousin ki tarah SuperGirl bhi Earth par bahut widely known superhero hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ab SuperGirl ke ek dialogue ke baad hum dekhte hain ki woh ek bus stop jaisi jagah par baithi hui hai. Jahan par bus ki jagah ek ajeeb sa spaceship jaisa vehicle aata hai. Par yeh vehicle dikhne mein bahut hi zyada Women of Tomorrow ke issue do mein dikhe Westward Hall Ferry jaisa dikhata hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhbQL4f53zusLpCbLAnjJhYIWhGd_NKYgcOS-2nxHJ9RcvxdUgdoV_hvmalzgrlXMvqNTPi19DGA6dW__FZ11NJkO7nJYpvywVx7MoGWSUhQYR042OU5-xQcAidBIVsKA7jOBvbo2XMdhn_ROP8CtK9tUZ8oWz9ApZmwkYq8Dj7yHPxe7XQwwiTcH9f9_k/s1280/BOLD.jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;720&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1280&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhbQL4f53zusLpCbLAnjJhYIWhGd_NKYgcOS-2nxHJ9RcvxdUgdoV_hvmalzgrlXMvqNTPi19DGA6dW__FZ11NJkO7nJYpvywVx7MoGWSUhQYR042OU5-xQcAidBIVsKA7jOBvbo2XMdhn_ROP8CtK9tUZ8oWz9ApZmwkYq8Dj7yHPxe7XQwwiTcH9f9_k/s16000/BOLD.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Argo City Aur Krypton Ki Tabahi&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ab uske theek baad humein dikhata hai Krypton aur Krypton ki tabahi ke saath humein dikh raha hai SuperGirl ka hometown yaani ki Argo City. Argo City kya hai aur uski story kya thi yeh jaanne ke liye aapko tension lene ki zarurat nahi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ek bahut hi interesting baat hui hai yahan par. Woh yeh hai ki DCU mein Krypton us tarah barbaad nahi hua jis tarah Man of Steel mein hua tha. Man of Steel mein humne dekha tha ki Krypton ke resources khatam hone ki wajah se aur bhayankar exploitation ki wajah se Krypton ka core collapse hone wala tha aur woh poora planet fatne wala tha.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Par yahan par jis tarah se buildings barbaad ho rahe hain use dekhkar aisa lag raha hai ki woh kisi bade strong shock wave se takrae ho. Aur aisa hone ka ek hi reason ho sakta hai doston aur woh yeh hai ki Krypton ka sun yaani Rao supernova mein badal raha hai. Aur usi supernova blast se jo power shock wave space ke through travel karke Krypton tak pahunche hain, wohi Krypton planet ko khatam kar rahe hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Main Villain: Krem of the Yellow Hills&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur phir humein pehla close up milta hai movie ke main villain Krem of the Yellow Hills ka. Movie mein Krem ka yeh jo look hai woh iske comic book version se bahut hi zyada alag hai. Par of course kyunki DCU abhi James Gunn ke haathon mein hai toh woh humein space pilot wala look toh dikhayenge hi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ab agle hi scene mein hum dekhte hain ki ek seat par baitha-baitha Ruthye ek sword nikalti hai. Yeh sword belong karta hai Krem ko jo Ruthye ke liye bahut important hai. Wahi yeh jagah bhi Halleer hai jis par baithkar Kara aur Ruthye inter-galactic travel kar rahe hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Iske baad hum Kara aur Ruthye ko ek corridor se bhagte hue dekh pa rahe hain aur woh dono bahar aate hain khidki tod kar. Yeh poori setup ussi fight wali location ka hai jahan Kara ki un space pirates se jharpah hui thi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Lobo Ka Dhamakedaar Entry&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wahi iske baad humein dikhata hai Lobo. Hamara main man Lobo aur Lobo ka yeh pehla look bahut hi zyada promising aur awesome lag raha hai. Aur Jason Momoa ka yeh look beskar clearly toh nahi dikh raha par yeh ekdam perfect lag raha hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wahi iske baad hum Kara ko sidha aasmaan ki taraf udate hue dekhte hain. Is scene mein aisa lag raha hai ki Kara upper atmosphere mein shock wave banati hui gayi hai. Jaisa ki maine kaha ki is story mein Kara ki powers aati jaati rahengi. Toh usko kai jagah fight karne mein dikkat ho sakti hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Final Thoughts&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Toh already Tom King ki SuperGirl Women of Tomorrow ka bahut bada fan hone ke naate mujhe toh yeh trailer bahut awesome laga. Main bas Krem ke look ko lekin thoda bahut hairaan hoon. Par uske alawa sab kuch toh bhai on point lag raha hai. Jiske saath-saath logon ka twist is story ko aur zyada interesting bana raha hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Par ab aap batao ki aapko yeh teaser trailer kaisa laga? Aap SuperGirl ke liye kitne excited ho aur aapke hisaab se kya yeh story Superman ki story se bhi better hogi?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agar aapko yeh breakdown achha laga toh channel ko subscribe karna na bhoolein aur saath hi saath ek step aage aakar apne favourite channel ko support karein membership lekin!&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/supergirl-teaser-breakdown-kya-hai.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhbQL4f53zusLpCbLAnjJhYIWhGd_NKYgcOS-2nxHJ9RcvxdUgdoV_hvmalzgrlXMvqNTPi19DGA6dW__FZ11NJkO7nJYpvywVx7MoGWSUhQYR042OU5-xQcAidBIVsKA7jOBvbo2XMdhn_ROP8CtK9tUZ8oWz9ApZmwkYq8Dj7yHPxe7XQwwiTcH9f9_k/s72-c/BOLD.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-8350447954153690185</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Dec 2025 16:09:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2025-12-12T21:39:56.253+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">blog</category><title>Tees Maar Khan: The Underrated Masterpiece That Finally Got Its Due!</title><description>&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Akshay Khanna Ka Oscar Wala Performance!&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dhurandhar movie release hone ke baad, main internet par dekh raha hoon ki log Akshay Khanna ke upar maar rahe hain! Reels bani hain, edits bani hain ki us picture mein kya acting kari thi? But ek aur cheez jo saath mein associate ki hai - &quot;Oscar type aise hi hota hai. Aatish Kapoor ko finally uska Oscar mil gaya!&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ye dekhkar mujhe itni fascination lag rahi hai ki finally, finally logone ekdam mainstream charo taraf Akshay Khanna ki wahwahi ho rahi hai. Unke talent ko dekha ja raha hai, appreciate kiya ja raha hai, aur ye dekhkar apne ko kaafi accha lag raha hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Those Who Knew All Along&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jinhone 2017 ke baad se unke comeback wali movies dekhi hain, they already knew ki &quot;bhai ye actor koi mamule nahi. Seedha Oscar type Oscar wardi.&quot; Ajay Devgan ki Drishyam 2 aai thi us time ka tum jaake discussion dekh lo. Log keh rahe hain ki Akshay Khanna ne ek acting kari hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Is saal Vicky Kaushal ki lead mein Chhava movie aai thi. Uske andar bhole bahut zyada scenes nahi the lekin jitne bhi the, aankhen khol dene wale. In fact uske tezz mein pehchaan mein nahi aa raha tha bhai ki wo Akshay Khanna hai!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Tees Maar Khan Connection&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;But fir mere ko realize hota hai ki log ab Tees Maar Khan ki itni zyada baat kar rahe hain. Uske sare clips kaat ke dikh rahe hain ki bande ne kya acting kari thi, kya performance diya tha us time pe. Aatish Kapoor &quot;Oscar Oscar&quot; wale aisa hi hota hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mere ko realize hua - wait! Main Tees Maar Khan ke upar retro review ek dhadh mahine pehle banane wala tha. Uske liye maine movie poori wapas se dekhi thi. YouTube ke upar free mein available hai. Maine poori script likh rakhi thi bhai ki &quot;acha main ye ye ye bolunga.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jab main ab wapas revisit kar raha hoon, to maine literally ye lines likhi hui hain ki &quot;ek baar Aatish Kapoor ki entry hui uske baad itna maja aaya. Akshay Khanna bhai ki acting ekdam commit kar jaati hai. Itna zyada commit kar diya ki 15 saal baad logon ko uski samajh aai.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shit! God damnet ka us time pe video bana diya hota to!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEimkiNY31KgbyWX-Mmqp2ulbpPVlQ-3A1gDPkCCdc3RZxXR_FDyN4pSNliSVFmRqZvaxDaOTLxv21l6K-myY4kbxLjN8JCFa5bozs95QkZb5eO_KLMmzcbmuqpu2ALwaY-3hMAH0ONTqAkCru5lVs1UAL863JUz9_7QRyQ_ypRVPTK5cY7d6sKdmuvNfTI/s1280/Untitled%20design%20(2).jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;720&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1280&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEimkiNY31KgbyWX-Mmqp2ulbpPVlQ-3A1gDPkCCdc3RZxXR_FDyN4pSNliSVFmRqZvaxDaOTLxv21l6K-myY4kbxLjN8JCFa5bozs95QkZb5eO_KLMmzcbmuqpu2ALwaY-3hMAH0ONTqAkCru5lVs1UAL863JUz9_7QRyQ_ypRVPTK5cY7d6sKdmuvNfTI/s16000/Untitled%20design%20(2).jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Why Tees Maar Khan Was Ahead of Its Time&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kya Tees Maar Khan actually a masterpiece thi jisko us time pe logone nahi samjha? Dhakka diya, laaton se maara ki &quot;ye chhi chhi kya bana diya hai&quot;?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agar tum pichle ek do saalon mein Tees Maar Khan ke kaafi saare edits reels wagherah pe dekh rahe ho, tumko dekhkar bahut zyada maja aa raha hoga ki bhai kya comedy hai! Lekin nahi pata ki jab ye comedy actually release hui thi to usko accha review nahi diya tha.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bhai main jaake internet pe dekh raha hoon. Un logone ek star, 1.5 star, do star diya hua hai. &quot;Low IQ wala term&quot; chhap diya hai picture ke upar. Haan, ye sab hua tha uske saath 2010 mein.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Rating Par Vishwas Mat Karo&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Isliye main do cheezen kehta hoon. Sabse pehla ki rating-waiting par vishwas mat karo. Ek star, do star, teen star, char star, paanch star. Kya hota hai star? Movie jo ki ek art form hai, usey aap ek number se kaise associate kar sakte ho?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Isliye Mocktail Meter is the best meter - seedha opinion based rating le lo ki ya to Skip, Time Pass, Go For It, ya Perfection. Picture dekhkar jo tumhara opinion hai, us opinion mein tum logon se baat karo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tum bhi aaj hi Mocktail join karo, link description mein hai kyon!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Genius of Deliberate Stupidity&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tees Maar Khan ko 2010 mein jaisa treat kiya tha, waisa aaj nahi treatment dekhne milega Mocktail ke upar. Rating kya hai? Iski 55% Go For It aur 13% logone ne Time Pass bhi diya hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ek user Normie2309 keh rahe hain: &quot;I will defend this movie till the day I die. This is genuinely funny and I&#39;m not talking just because of nostalgia. After watching so many times, I believe I got a little bit of perspective to judge comedy and this film&#39;s comedy is genuinely smart. It&#39;s so deliberately stupid, it&#39;s genius.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&quot;Its so deliberately dumb stupid.&quot; Jai ho jo gaana aaya tha jisko Oscar mila tha, usko tumne de ho kar diya aur usko leke tum ghus gaye. Wo log baat pe de ho de ho kar rahe hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Judge Movies for What They Are&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Doosri cheez jo main reviews ko leke kehta hoon na ki aapko har ek movie us perspective se judge karna chahiye ki usko banaya kis liye hai. Tees Maar Khan jaisi movies ko aap Interstellar wala mind leke dekhne jaoge ki &quot;ekdam mere ko to cinema chahiye&quot; to tumhara nazriya hi galat hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Iska matlab ye nahi hota ki aaj ke time pe comedy ke naam pe jo high budget &quot;bawaseer&quot; wo log bana rahe hain, wo funny ho gaya. Tum apna dimaag band karke dekhne jaao to movie badhiya hai. Nahi, kyonki dimaag band karne ke baad bhi &quot;its not funny.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jo main kehne ki koshish kar raha hoon, uska live example agar tumko dekhna hai to do movies back to back dekhna: Tees Maar Khan aur Son of Sardaar 2. Dono mein aapko apna dimaag band karna hai, lekin ek mein aapko kaafi maja aa sakta hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Power of Memes and Social Media&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hum log understand nahi kar sakte reels ne jo aajkal ke short form clips karte hain, popular media ke andar memes jis tarah se chalte hain, wo logon ka perception badal dete hain. Tum ek alag meaning attach kar lete ho us moment se, us scene se.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Herapheri ka ek bahut best example hai. Tumne shayad pehle jab dekha hoga uske chhote-mote scenes gaye, jaise Herapheri mein Baburao ka character kehta hai &quot;kya gunda banega re tu&quot; wo tab tumko shayad utna funny na laga hoga. Lekin ab uske around itna saara context ban chuka hai ki ab jab tum usko dekhoge to &quot;will like&quot; yaha pe hai wo badhiya, notice karoge, appreciate karoge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ye impact hota hai memes ka - pop culture mein baar-baar circulate karne se. Aur usne Tees Maar Khan ko definitely help kiya hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Acting That Transcended Cringe&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ek cheez jisko bilkul bhi ignore nahi kiya ja sakta ki is movie ke andar jo actors the, jo director hai, Farah Khan jis type ka material unke saamne hai, usey leke itna ghus jaana, itna zyada commit kar jaana ki agar aap overacting kar rahe ho to itna ghus ke overacting karo ki wo cringe wali valley se paar jaye - &quot;its cringe is good.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur wo cheez har ek actor ke performance se feel hoti hai. Katrina ka to famous hai. Main jab wapas se revisit kar raha tha, main dekh ke keh raha tha &quot;yaar tum jab wo act kar rahe ho wahan par jab shot ko cut kaha ja raha hai, tumko nahi realize ho raha ki &#39;maybe this is too much&#39;.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jis tarah se wo English action mein ka &quot;garib Hindustani aur khoon paseeni commitment, share commitment&quot; - tumko wo act karne bol do. Abhi karte-karte paseene nikal jaenge. Bhai kitna cringe kar raha hoon main! Lekin wahan 150 logon ke saamne karna. &quot;Ye to French cinema hai. Isko to Oscar milni chahiye!&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Why Tees Maar Khan Is Still Relevant&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Movie kitni wacky hai, kitni absurd jaane wali hai. Iske poster se hi samajh mein aata hai - &quot;ye kya pose mara hai?&quot; Hello, haan Akshay sir aaj hai na poster ki shooting hai. Aap aaiye aur aap aise let jaiye. Fir Katrina aapke upar let jaengi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ek cheez samajh mein nahi aai ki picture ke starting mein jo baby wala CGI apne ko dikhate hain - &quot;how is it so good?&quot; 15 saal bhi wo aajkal ki kuch movies se kyun better lag raha hai? &quot;French cinema!&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tumko agar doubt hai na ki wo aajkal ke CGI se better nahi hai to 2022 mein iske kitne saal ho gaye? 12 saal baad ek movie aai thi &quot;Kalk&quot; naam se. Uske andar ek bull wala CGI dala hua hai. Wo jaake dekho bhai!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Comedy That Was Ahead of Its Time&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Picture mein Tees Maar Khan ka title track aata hai. &quot;Its its so catchy!&quot; Shuru mein gag ke naam pe jo cheezen dikhayi hain ki dono bhai judwa hain, chikke hain. Andaza aa jaata hai ki &quot;this is not a serious movie.&quot; Aur saath mein kitni zyada racist bhi!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ismail Sheikh aka Ismail &quot;Coala&quot; - picture ke andar ye literal dialogue hai ki &quot;Smile coale se zyada kaala hai ya coala Smile se zyada kaala.&quot; Aur yahan par movie ke definitely points cut hote hain kyonki wo andhere mein smile karke batti jalane wala hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flight wala jo poora scene aata hai jisme wo police ko chakma deke sab kuch chhod leta hai. Usme ek minister ki ladki ka accident suna hai? Main aai like &quot;ye to Katrina se bhi zyada fake hai!&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sheela ki Jawani gaana play hota hai aur mujhe nostalgia hit gaya bhai ki us time pe Munni Badnaam ke baad ye itna zyada rage mein tha. 2010 mein 13 saal ka badal &quot;Sheela ki Jawani&quot; sun ke jo rage mein tha...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Meme Culture That Saved Tees Maar Khan&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reels ne jo aajkal ke short form clips karte hain, popular media ke andar memes jis tarah se chalte hain, wo logon ka perception badal dete hain. Tum ek alag meaning attach kar lete ho us moment se, us scene se.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Herapheri ka ek bahut best example hai. Tumne shayad pehle jab dekha hoga uske chhote-mote scenes gaye, jaise Herapheri mein Baburao ka character kehta hai &quot;kya gunda banega re tu&quot; wo tab tumko shayad utna funny na laga hoga. Lekin ab uske around itna saara context ban chuka hai ki ab jab tum usko dekhoge to &quot;will like&quot; yaha pe hai wo badhiya, notice karoge, appreciate karoge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ye impact hota hai memes ka - pop culture mein baar-baar circulate karne se. Aur usne Tees Maar Khan ko definitely help kiya hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Legacy of Tees Maar Khan&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Log ab realize kar rahe hain ki Tees Maar Khan was a masterpiece. Main to kehta hoon &quot;this is the finest highest film ever made - the French cinema hai!&quot; Isko to Oscar milna chahiye!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jab main revisit kar raha hoon na to dekhte hi dekhte picture ke 40 minute kahan nikal gaye, mujhe nahi idea laga. &quot;It was so ingrossing, engaging - French cinema!&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Even jo ek gaana aata hai jisme Salman Khan ka cameo aate hain &quot;bhaijaan&quot; aur bhaijaan kya naach hai! Isme Salman Khan ko dance karte hue dekh ke lag raha hai ki &quot;he is enjoying this shit&quot; itna zyada ki wo dekhkar apne ko maja aa raha hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lekin &quot;Man of the Match&quot; ki baat karni padhegi - Akshay Khanna! Short mein jab wo aage hai, peeche hai, side mein hai - jo ekdam hota hai na ki wo &quot;Oscar wali acting&quot; kari. &quot;Maja aa gaya bhai! Its so brain rot!&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur pichle 15 saalon mein in logon ka dimaag itna zyada brain rot ho chuka hai ki us time pe society jo apne aap ko yahan maanti thi, wo ab is movie ke level pe aa chuki hai. Ya fir hum log galat the is pure time pe - movie ka level alag tha aur poori society uske level pe aa chuki hai.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Difference Between Old and New Comedy&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ek interesting cheez maine notice ki - tumko ek bande ka naam batata hoon agar idea nahi hai: Sharish Kundan, jo ki Farah Khan ke husband hain. Is movie ke andar ek character ko gadi thokti hai, wo jhad pe jaake baith jaata hai aur kaafi saare scenes usne jhad pe kiye hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ye dekhkar mere ko realize hua - &quot;Oh! Toh Joker movie jo aai thi uska inspiration yahan se mila tha!&quot; Bhai jis din Akshumar ki Joker movie normalize ho gayi na log usko masterpiece kahne lage, samajh jaana ki &quot;duniya khatam hai.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Grand Finale&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Picture khatam ho gayi. End mein unhone ek poora sequence daala bhai jahan pe movie banane wali Tees Maar Khan ko banane mein jo bhi crew wagherah hai, wo stage pe aate hain aur Oscars lete hain, awards le rahe hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tumko pata bhi hai ye Mr. Sharish Kundan kitni baar stage pe aaye the award lene ke liye? Nahi idea to jaake end wala song direct play karna.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sabse pehle wo aata hai, do-do award ek saath aaya, do leke gaya. Fir thodi der baad aaya ek baar aur fir ek leke gaya. Fir thodi der baad aata hai ek baar aur fir ek aur leke gaya. Surprisingly, Bhushan Kumar bhi entry maarte hain. T-Series ke malik jinke baad Mr. Sharish Kundar fir aate hain. Fir uske baad ek baar fir aate hain. Fir uske baad fir ek baar aur aate hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Total kitne ho gaye? Kyon? Kyonki &quot;jitna main dekh pa raha hoon ki story unhone likhi hai, main bhi shayad screenplay bhi likha hi hoga. Producer wo hain, editor wo hain, music bhi unhone diya hua hai. Aur jab ghar ki murgi hai to do aur aur ek extra le hi leta hoon!&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Final Verdict&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Actually is movie ko dekhkar mujhe ek aur cheez kaafi strongly feel hui ki ye jo purani comedy movies ke reels kathte hain, uske memes bante hain, aaj log unko kaafi acchi memory se yaad karte hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unmein aur aajkal ki comedy movies mein ek kaafi bada difference hai ki pehle ka jo comedy tha, wo kaafi zyada physical tha. Camera move kar raha tha, characters move kar rahe the, wo kuch kar rahe the scene ke andar. Aaj ke time pe sab ek line mein khade ho jaate hain aur ek-ek dialogue maarte hain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aur shayad isliye log un purani movies ko aur zyada cherish kar rahe hain. Itne saalon baad unko realize ho raha hai ki &quot;maybe Tees Maar Khan was a masterpiece. Maybe it was ahead of its time.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Main to kehta hoon &quot;this is the finest highest film ever made - the French cinema hai!&quot; Isko to Oscar milna chahiye!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nahi yaar, but alag ho gayi, lekin dekhne mein maja aaya. Tees Maar Khan dekhne mein kaafi maja aaya. Movie jiske liye banai hui hai, poori ki poori wahi deliver karti hai!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What are your thoughts on Tees Maar Khan? Have you revisited it recently? Let me know in the comments below!&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/tees-maar-khan-underrated-masterpiece.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEimkiNY31KgbyWX-Mmqp2ulbpPVlQ-3A1gDPkCCdc3RZxXR_FDyN4pSNliSVFmRqZvaxDaOTLxv21l6K-myY4kbxLjN8JCFa5bozs95QkZb5eO_KLMmzcbmuqpu2ALwaY-3hMAH0ONTqAkCru5lVs1UAL863JUz9_7QRyQ_ypRVPTK5cY7d6sKdmuvNfTI/s72-c/Untitled%20design%20(2).jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-8853600802978283017</guid><pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 12:24:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-01-07T22:58:22.130+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">2024</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">action/comedy</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">movie</category><title>Panda Plan</title><description>&lt;p&gt;My face hurts. Like, physically hurts. I think I pulled a muscle in my cheek from laughing. It’s 1:47 AM and I just got back from the cinema and I think I’m still a little bit deaf from the surround sound. My friend bailed on me last minute, so I went alone. Don&#39;t judge me. I’d been seeing the posters for *Panda Plan* for weeks and I just… I needed it, you know?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;So there I was, in this giant, half-empty theater, with a bucket of popcorn that was bigger than my head. The previews were all for these super serious, dramatic Oscar-bait movies, and I was just sitting there like, &quot;Just get to the bear, please.&quot; And then it started. And oh dude. Oh, dude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhfAXa9dvp8bEaYcTinqnNDUclLDZmTuuO1ej3VzuI84QHuW2nCDsfxR6WA379KlVNk2w4o50KelULflc-ZPBrYmFLEu-CAm3LcMErZLgZJ0QX7QjJl29Y327dgZIQP3eS9_WB7-ifWbkc54_iafLp9VmszsgNb0ReRibg2T3KfFTnlFRGDWY5keRDUChw/s1080/8iMPQl13q89jQhaA5nXb6UiT0t0.jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;607&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1080&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhfAXa9dvp8bEaYcTinqnNDUclLDZmTuuO1ej3VzuI84QHuW2nCDsfxR6WA379KlVNk2w4o50KelULflc-ZPBrYmFLEu-CAm3LcMErZLgZJ0QX7QjJl29Y327dgZIQP3eS9_WB7-ifWbkc54_iafLp9VmszsgNb0ReRibg2T3KfFTnlFRGDWY5keRDUChw/s16000/8iMPQl13q89jQhaA5nXb6UiT0t0.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is exactly what you think it is. It is somehow even dumber and more brilliant than you could possibly imagine. The plot is… I mean, does it even matter? There&#39;s a panda. He has a plan. There are some bad guys with hilariously bad Russian accents. The plan involves a lot of acrobatics and a surprising amount of property damage. That&#39;s it. That&#39;s the movie.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And I was 100% there for it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There&#39;s this one moment. This one, single, perfect moment of cinematic stupidity that I will carry with me forever. The panda, his name is Bao Bao or something, is sneaking through a fancy mansion. He&#39;s wearing this tiny little black ninja mask, which is just… it’s the cutest thing I’ve ever seen. He comes across this big, burly henchman guarding a door. The henchman is all tough, flexing his muscles, whispering into his walkie-talkie. And Bao Bao just… picks up a tiny porcelain figurine of a poodle from a nearby table. He looks at the henchman, looks at the poodle, and just *chucks* it at the guy&#39;s head. It shatters into a million pieces and the guy just goes down like a sack of potatoes. No sound effect. Just a tiny *tink* and then a thud. I lost it. I absolutely lost it. I was wheezing. I was crying. I think the two other people in the theater were judging me so hard but I could not stop laughing. I think I snorted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It refinded me of this one time in college when I tried to be all smooth and impress this girl at a party by, like, juggling some empty bottles. I&#39;d never juggled anything in my life. I thought, &quot;How hard can it be?&quot; I picked up three beer bottles, tossed them in the air, and immediately smashed all three of them on the floor. The whole party just went silent. I just stood there, surrounded by glass and my own shattered dignity, and was like, &quot;…Ta-da?&quot; Anyway. The panda&#39;s aim was way better than mine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But honestly, now that I&#39;m typing this… was it actually a good movie? Or was I just so desperate for something dumb and fun that my brain just switched off? The human actors were trying, I guess. You could see the desperation in their eyes, trying to act like a talking, kung-fu-fighting panda was a completely normal thing to be interacting with. I thought I was having the time of my life, but now that I&#39;m thinking about it… was the dialogue just a series of terrible puns? Yes. Was the villain&#39;s masterplan idiotic? Absolutely. Did I care for even a second? Not at all.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The whole cinema experience was key, though. Seeing that panda on a giant, three-story-high screen, with every little fart and rumble amplified by the bass… it was epic. At home, on a laptop, this movie would be nothing. It would be forgettable. But in that theater, with my sticky floor and my overpriced soda, it was a religious experience. I was a disciple of the Church of the Panda Plan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;So yeah. My brain is mush. I feel like I just mainlined pure, uncut silliness. I don&#39;t regret a single second. My face still hurts from laughing. I&#39;m probably going to have dreams about ninja pandas tonight. And you know what? I&#39;m okay with that.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whatever. I need to sleep this off.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;7/10. Go see it with the lowest possible expectations and a friend who laughs at stupid stuff. Or alone. No judgment here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;solid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/panda-plan.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhfAXa9dvp8bEaYcTinqnNDUclLDZmTuuO1ej3VzuI84QHuW2nCDsfxR6WA379KlVNk2w4o50KelULflc-ZPBrYmFLEu-CAm3LcMErZLgZJ0QX7QjJl29Y327dgZIQP3eS9_WB7-ifWbkc54_iafLp9VmszsgNb0ReRibg2T3KfFTnlFRGDWY5keRDUChw/s72-c/8iMPQl13q89jQhaA5nXb6UiT0t0.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-6521729155692608955</guid><pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 12:17:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2025-12-11T17:47:58.078+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">2024</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">movie</category><title>Phullwanti </title><description>&lt;p&gt;Dude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Just finished &lt;b&gt;Phullwanti &lt;/b&gt;and my brain is just... buzzing. Like a beehive. A very, very colorful, melodious beehive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I had to, like, *hunt* this one down. Not on Netflix, not on Prime. Had to find a... let&#39;s call it a &quot;special&quot; version online. So I&#39;m hunched over my laptop, the screen brightness way down so I don&#39;t blind myself, and the quality was a bit grainy, you know? Like watching an old VHS tape. But honestly? It kinda added to the vibe. Made it feel more... timeless. I paused it halfway through to get some water and just stood in my dark kitchen for a minute, trying to process what I was even watching.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kya baat hai, yaar. Seriously. What a film.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And that girl... that actress playing Phullwanti. What&#39;s her name? Sayali Sanjeev? Wow. Just... wow. She&#39;s not just acting, she *is* Phullwanti. There&#39;s this fire in her eyes, man. This quiet confidence that&#39;s just... intimidating and beautiful at the same time. I was completely mesmerized.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgCvpqw7UVyZHGuFamLZB5jW5wcelss00VuI4dQT1LIFgKBnxyVAZyc6By1-UlLF6yPYAs7rP7OZDim5Y2xynVqlcPbJfDi3y6YYaX3sbYm39YIJtpDeu_2Ro5YbC4k_et4sQLK2XAjQ5tqEoQUMPTdlY5bmIrMIoji_hmuSb-Z0gVrOUaIU4xYDjMSuQg/s1080/1vZBlfnbFAiwedoBTBohJH2LD9O.jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;607&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1080&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgCvpqw7UVyZHGuFamLZB5jW5wcelss00VuI4dQT1LIFgKBnxyVAZyc6By1-UlLF6yPYAs7rP7OZDim5Y2xynVqlcPbJfDi3y6YYaX3sbYm39YIJtpDeu_2Ro5YbC4k_et4sQLK2XAjQ5tqEoQUMPTdlY5bmIrMIoji_hmuSb-Z0gVrOUaIU4xYDjMSuQg/s16000/1vZBlfnbFAiwedoBTBohJH2LD9O.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;There&#39;s this one scene that&#39;s just stuck in my head, looping over and over. It&#39;s not a big, dramatic moment. It&#39;s just her, sitting in this courtyard, doing embroidery. The camera is super close up, just on her hands and the fabric. And the way the needle moves, it&#39;s like it&#39;s dancing. It&#39;s so precise, so deliberate. And she&#39;s having this conversation with this big-shot scholar who&#39;s trying to test her, you know? Trying to show her that he&#39;s smarter than her. And she doesn&#39;t even look up. She just keeps stitching, and her answers are so sharp, so witty, they just slice through his ego. I literally leaned forward so close to my laptop screen I almost smudged it with my nose. I was just... captivated. It was so quiet, but it was louder than any shouting match I&#39;ve ever seen in a movie. The way she just dismantled his entire argument without breaking a sweat... pure poetry, man.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It reminds me of my daadi, actually. She used to do all this intricate embroidery too. She had these old sarees with the most beautiful patterns, and she&#39;d tell me these stories about the women in her village, these super strong women who could run a household and a farm and still find time to create these amazing works of art. She told me this one story about a woman who challenged a bunch of men to a debate about religion, and she won just by asking these simple, logical questions that they couldn&#39;t answer. I was just a kid, but I remember thinking, &quot;Wow, women are secretly running the world.&quot; Wait, why am I telling you this? So random. Anyway. This movie felt like one of my daadi&#39;s stories come to life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And the music! Don&#39;t even get me started on the music. It&#39;s just... it flows through the whole movie. It&#39;s not just background noise, it&#39;s like a character. I had my headphones on, and it felt like I was right there in that village, under the stars, listening to these songs. I think I might have downloaded the soundtrack already. Don&#39;t judge me.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But... okay, now that I&#39;m typing this... I have a doubt. Was the romance subplot actually necessary? I mean, the guy was fine, I guess. Charming and all that. But Phullwanti was such a powerhouse on her own. Did she really need a love interest to validate her? I thought I loved their scenes together, I really did. But now that the movie&#39;s over and I&#39;m thinking about it... was it a bit of a cliché? Did it take away from her story of being this independent, brilliant woman? I don&#39;t know, man. I&#39;m conflicted. Maybe I&#39;m just overthinking it. Maybe I just wanted her to be happy, and in our minds, happy means being in love. Ugh. Whatever.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The whole thing just felt so... authentic. The clothes, the houses, the way people talked. It wasn&#39;t a glossy, perfect version of the past. It felt real. Lived-in. I felt like I could smell the food cooking and feel the dust on the ground. Watching it on my small, slightly blurry laptop screen made it feel even more intimate, like I was peeking into someone&#39;s memories.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Honestly, I&#39;m still processing it. It&#39;s not a movie you just watch and forget. It kind of... settles in you. Makes you think about art, and intelligence, and what it means to be strong. I feel all... thoughtful and emotional now. Ugh. I hate it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Okay, my brain is officially fried. I need to sleep before the sun comes up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;9/10. Go watch it. Or find a &quot;special&quot; version. You won&#39;t regret it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;solid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- raghu yadav&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/phullwanti.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgCvpqw7UVyZHGuFamLZB5jW5wcelss00VuI4dQT1LIFgKBnxyVAZyc6By1-UlLF6yPYAs7rP7OZDim5Y2xynVqlcPbJfDi3y6YYaX3sbYm39YIJtpDeu_2Ro5YbC4k_et4sQLK2XAjQ5tqEoQUMPTdlY5bmIrMIoji_hmuSb-Z0gVrOUaIU4xYDjMSuQg/s72-c/1vZBlfnbFAiwedoBTBohJH2LD9O.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-1134413930397870154</guid><pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 12:09:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2025-12-11T17:39:49.679+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">2024</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">ishaan</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">movie</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">south movie</category><title>Darling</title><description>&lt;p&gt;I need to turn on every single light in my apartment right now. It’s almost midnight and my cat, Jones, is just staring at the hallway door like he can see something I can&#39;t. Thanks, *Darling*. Thanks for that. Just finished it on Shudder and I feel... unclean. Not in a gross way, but in a psychological, I-need-to-bleach-my-brain kind of way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;My heart is still doing this weird little fluttery thing. Like a trapped moth. There&#39;s this one scene... this one shot that is just burned onto the inside of my eyelids. The main character, she&#39;s just standing in her kitchen, right? It’s dead silent. And she&#39;s making tea, just this mundane, boring thing. But the camera is behind her, reflected in the polished steel of the fridge. And for a split second, you see another reflection in the reflection. A shadow. Just standing behind her in the reflection of the fridge. It&#39;s not really there. It&#39;s just... a glitch in the light. But I saw it. I physically recoiled on my couch. My knee hit the coffee table and I swear I saw stars for a second. I had to pause it. Just sat there in the dark, breathing heavily, wondering if I&#39;d actually seen it or if my sleep-deprived brain was just playing tricks on me. That&#39;s the kind of movie this is. It gets inside your head and starts rearranging the furniture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It reminded me of this one time when I was a kid, maybe 8 or 9, and I went to my friend&#39;s house. His family had this old, antique doll collection in a glass case in the hallway. The dolls all had these porcelain faces and glass eyes that seemed to follow you. I hated walking past that case. One day, I was the last one to leave, and the hallway was dark, and I swear to god, one of the dolls had its head turned. It was facing the front of the case when I went in, and when I walked out, it was looking right at me. I ran out of that house so fast I almost tripped over my own feet. I never went back. Wait, why am I even telling you this? It&#39;s so random. Anyway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg4pE7tGqvguBIHrdjVvj73axcedwQHBbbPRi-XVvItT42YkU9jBo3xwkJrEmcyFN3n-3dS186CcEOXAG5Y-JAPyL_Lfr4yv4Vh_ny5vNtKjyebaPiy9L-L1zs-kdzTrzsNknSjiDWOyf75vWKHpOC17flug2mbiiktXqhCMa9Nbh_EIGgncaxqfZrGzak/s1080/qY4Xwbq0NnwErp2sPZOaQwpSGMv.jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;607&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1080&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg4pE7tGqvguBIHrdjVvj73axcedwQHBbbPRi-XVvItT42YkU9jBo3xwkJrEmcyFN3n-3dS186CcEOXAG5Y-JAPyL_Lfr4yv4Vh_ny5vNtKjyebaPiy9L-L1zs-kdzTrzsNknSjiDWOyf75vWKHpOC17flug2mbiiktXqhCMa9Nbh_EIGgncaxqfZrGzak/s16000/qY4Xwbq0NnwErp2sPZOaQwpSGMv.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The lead actress... what&#39;s her name... the one who looks like a young Mia Farrow? Her performance is just... insane. She barely says anything for the entire first hour. It&#39;s all just these micro-expressions. The way her eyes track a fly across the room. The slight tremor in her hand when she picks up a knife. I was completely captivated. But now that I&#39;m sitting here typing this... was it actually good acting? Or was it just a masterclass in looking vacant? I don&#39;t know. Maybe I&#39;m just a sucker for a spooky girl in a retro apartment. I thought I loved her performance, but now that I&#39;m thinking about it, was it actually kind of one-note? Ugh. I can&#39;t decide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The whole thing is just so... quiet. And slow. It&#39;s a slow burn in the truest sense of the word. It’s just this woman, alone in this gorgeous, but isolating, New York apartment. And things start to get weird. Or do they? Is it all in her head? The movie never really tells you. It just leaves you there to drown in the ambiguity. I spent the last 30 minutes just whispering &quot;what is happening?&quot; to my empty living room. Jones was no help, he was too busy staring at the ghost in the hallway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Watching it at home on Shudder was definitely the right call, though. I don&#39;t think I could&#39;ve handled the slow pace in a theater. I would&#39;ve been too aware of the people around me, crunching their popcorn. Here, I could pause it when I got too antsy. I could get up and pace around my coffee table during the really tense bits. The darkness of my own apartment, with just the glow of the TV, made it feel so much more claustrophobic. It felt like the walls of my living room were shrinking. At one point, a floorboard creaked in my apartment and I literally jumped out of my skin. It was just the building settling, but for a second... for a second I thought it was her.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I don&#39;t know what the ending meant. Honestly. I have no clue. Was it a ghost story? A story about grief? A story about a woman having a complete mental breakdown in a high-rent apartment? Maybe all three? It doesn&#39;t really matter, I guess. The feeling it leaves you with is the point. It&#39;s this deep, unsettling sense of dread that just clings to you. I feel like I need to go watch a cartoon or something, just to reset my brain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whatever. I&#39;m probably going to be checking behind my shower curtain for the next week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;7/10. It’s more of an experience than a movie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;decent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- ishaan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.mwsguy.com/2025/12/darling.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg4pE7tGqvguBIHrdjVvj73axcedwQHBbbPRi-XVvItT42YkU9jBo3xwkJrEmcyFN3n-3dS186CcEOXAG5Y-JAPyL_Lfr4yv4Vh_ny5vNtKjyebaPiy9L-L1zs-kdzTrzsNknSjiDWOyf75vWKHpOC17flug2mbiiktXqhCMa9Nbh_EIGgncaxqfZrGzak/s72-c/qY4Xwbq0NnwErp2sPZOaQwpSGMv.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-1056021179195438855.post-5055444013685616799</guid><pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 12:02:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-01-09T15:07:28.216+05:30</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">2024</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">alex</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">hollywood</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">horror/mystery</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">movie</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">movie review details and more</category><title>MaXXXine movie review / detail and more about MaXXXine and x</title><description>&lt;div class=&quot;ds-article-wrapper&quot;&gt;

